<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id"/>
  <para style="toc3">Mrc</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrc</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marc</para>
  <para style="toc1">Evanghelul dupã Marc</para>
  <para style="mt">Evanghelul dupã Marcu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu Discljidi Calea al Isus Hristos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Ahurhirea a Evanghelului al Isus Hristos, Hiljilu al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Ashã cum easti scriatã la prufitlu Isaia:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">
    <char style="it">“Ia, mini [Dumnidzãlu] ma pitrec mandatorlu a meu dininti a fatsãljei a ta,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">
    <char style="it">tsi va s-ndreagã calea a ta dininti a ta,</char><verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>
    <char style="it">boatsea atsilui tsi aurlã tu irnjiã:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">
    <char style="it">‘Ndridzets-lu calea a Domnului,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">
    <char style="it">ndreptatsã cãljurili a lui!’”</char><verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Ioanul vini tu irnjiã ti pãtidzari, predicãnda un pãtidzari trã mitãnjusirea a amãrtiilor tsi Dumnidzãulu s-li ljeartã. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Sh-tut loclu al Iudei sh-atselji dit Ierusalim nãdzea la elu shi s-pãtidza tuts di la nãsu la rãulu Iordan spunãnda amãrtiili a lor. <verse eid="MRK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Ma Ioanul eara nviscut cu stranji di lãnã ali gãmili, tsãnea un curauã di chealã anvãrliga di ilji shi mãca carcalets sh-njeari agrã. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Elu ma predica dzãcãnda: “Dupã mini yini un tsi easti ma vãrtos di mini. Mini nu escu axiu nits s-mi apunã dininti a lui ti dizlãgari lãgãtura a-sandalilor a lui. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Mini vã pãtidzai cu apã, ma elu va vã pãtidzeascã cu Duhlu Sãmt.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pãtidzarea shi Cãrtarea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Sh-tu atseali dzãli undzi tsi Isusul vini di la Nazaretul a Galileiljei shi s-pãtidzã di la Ioanul tu Iordan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Shi dinãoara cãndu ma insha di apã, vidzu cã tserurli ma s-discljidea shi Duhlu ma dipuna pri nãsu ca pãrumbu. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Sh-unã boatsã vini dit tserul: “Tini eshtã Hiljilu a meu vrut cu cai escã hãrãsit.” <verse eid="MRK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Sh-dinãoarã Duhlu Sãnt lu-adusi tu irnjii. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Shi eara tu irnjiã patrudzãtsi di dzãli, bãgat tu cãrteari di Satanlu. Sh-eara deadun cu agrãlji, shi anghilji l-huzmitipsea.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Acljimarea a Ucenitsilor di Prota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Shi dupã tsi Ioanul u hãpsãnirã, Isus vini tu Galilei predicãnda evanghelul al Dumnidzãul. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>Sh-dzãcãnda: “Agiumsi chirolu shi s-apruchiã amirãriljea al Dumnidzãul. Mitãnjusits-vã sh-pistipsits evanghelul.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Trãcãnda prininga amarea a Galileiljei, vidzu Simonlu sh-Andrea, fratili a lui, arcãnda plãsile tu amari cã earau piscari. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Shi Isus u dzãsi atslor: “Urmatsmã shi mini va vã facã piscari a oamnjilor.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Sh-trãoarã atselji li alãsarã plãsile shi s-dusirã dupã nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Dupã tsi imnã ninga niheam, vidzu Iacovul, hiljilu al Zebedeu shi Ioan, fratili a lui tsi mpitica plãsile a lor tu varcã. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Sh-trãoarã li-achljimã shi elji lu-alãsarã tatilu a lor, Zevedeul tu varcã cu lucrãtorlji, shi s-dusirã dupã nãsu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vindicarea a Demonizatlui dit Capernaum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Deapoea intrarã tu Capernaum shi dzua di Sãmbãta trãoarã intrarã tu sinagogã shi nvitsa oaminjlji. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Sh-oaminjlji s-ciudisirã di nvitsãtura-a lui, cã elu li nvitsa ca un tsi ari puteari sh-nu ca scriblji. <verse eid="MRK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Atumtsea tu sinagoga-a lor eara un om putut cu un duh nicurat, tsi ahurhi s-aurlã, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>dzãcãnda: “Tsi ari namisa di noi sh-di voi, Isus di Nazaret? Vinish tsi s-ni cherdzã? Mini lu shtiu cai eshtã: Sãmtulu al Dumnidzãul.” <verse eid="MRK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Shi Isusul lu ursi dzãcãnda: “Pãpsea shi easã di la nãs.” <verse eid="MRK 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Shi duhlu nicurat, dupã tsi lu apustusi shi aurlãnda cu mari inshi di la nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Sh-tuts s-ciudisirã ahtãt mult cãt ntriba un-alantu dzãcãnda: Vahi tsi easti atsea? Tsi nvitsiturã noauã easti atsea? Aestu li urseashti cu puteari shi duhurili nicurati shi elji lu ascultã. <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Shi anamea a lui s-avdzã dinãoarã pri tutã loclu avãrliga a Galileiljei.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vindicarea a Soacrãljei al Petru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Cum ishirã elji dit sinagogã, s-dusirã la casa al Simon shi al Andrei, cu Iacovul sh-cu Ioanul. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Soacra al Simon eara bãgatã cu heavrã, shi dinãoarã elji lji-spusirã ti nãsã. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Atumtsea elu s-apruchiã, lu-acãtsã di mãnã shi-u sculã. Trãoarã hevrili u-alãsarã shi ea acãtã s-lã huzmitipseascã. <verse eid="MRK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Seara dupã ascãpitarea a-soarilui, lji adusirã tuts lãndzitslji shi dracuitslji. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Sh-tutã cãsãbãulu eara adunat nãinti ali ushi. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Elu vindicã mults di atselji tsi s-munduia di multi soi ti lãngoari, shi aĝiuni mults drats, sh-nu alãsã dratsilji s-greascã, cã elji lu-cunushtea.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Deapoea, dimineatsa curund cãndu ninga nu avea apirit, Isusul si-sculã, inshi shi s-dusi tu un loc ermu shi aclo s-pãrãcãlsii. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Shi Simonlu sh-atselji tsi eara cu nãsu, lu-cãfta. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Shi cãndu lu aflarã lji-dzãsirã: “Tuts ma ti caftã.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Shi elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Hai s-nidzem tu hoarili di aproapi tsi s-predicã shi-aclo, cã ti aestã am vinitã.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Shi elu tricu tutã Galilea predicãnda pri sinagogãli-a lor shi aĝunea dratslji.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vindicarea a Leproslui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Shi vini la elu un lepros, tsi pãrãcãlsãnda lj-cãdzu pi dzinuclji sh-lji dzãsi: “Ma s-vrei tini, pots s-mi curi.” <verse eid="MRK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Shi Isusul sãmtsãnda njilã, lu timsi mãna pri nãs sh-lji dzãsi: “Ie, voi, s-hii curat!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Ma cãt dzãsi aesti, dinãoarã lepra lu-alãsã shi s-vindicã. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Deapoea, dupã tsi lu-ursi, trãoarã lu dipãrtã, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>dzãcãnda: “Vedz s-nu lji spunji tsiva-a vãrui, ma imnã la preftu, shi dã tsiva trã curarea-a ta, cum easti ursit tu legile a Moisiului, ca mãrtirii trã nãsh.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Ma elu, inshinda, apãrnji s-greascã shi s-scurpiseascã la mults faptulu, ahtãt mult cãt Isusul nu putea s-intra discljis tu cãsãbã, ma stãtea nafoarã pri locuri ermi. Sh-di tuti pãrtsili yinea la nãsu.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Paralizatlu al Capernaum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Dupã ndoauã dzãli, Isus vini nãpoi tu Capernaum shi s-avdzã cã elu eara la casã. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Dinãoarã s-adunarã ahãnts mults oaminji cãt nu aflai loc nitsi dininti ali poarti. Sh-elu lã nvitsa zborlu. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Atumtsea vinirã niscãnts, tsi adusirã un om paralizat tsi lu-purta patru inshi. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Ma niputãnda s-apruchia ti itia a multsamiljei, dizvãlirã plocili a citiljei iu eara Isusul, shi dupã tsi disfeatsirã unã guvã lu-dipusirã patlu pi cai stãtea paralizatlu. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Isusul vidzãnda pistea a lor ljã-dzãsi a paralizatlui: “Hiljie, amãrtiili a tali sãntu ljirtati!” <verse eid="MRK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Ma atsia shidea niscãntsã scribi tsi tu ininjli a lor minduia: <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>“Cãtse vahi aestu ma blastimã? Cai poati s-ljeartã amãrtiili, singur di Dumnidzãul?” <verse eid="MRK 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Ma Isusul tsi trãoarã aduchi tu suflitlu a lui cã elji ma mintuia aesti lucri cu mintea-a lor, lã dzãsi: “Cãtse li mintuits aesti lucri tu ininjli a voastri? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Tsi easti ma lishor s-ljã dzãtsã a paralizatlui: ‘Amãrtiili a tali sãntu ljirtati’, ama s-ljã dzãtsã: ‘Scoalã-ti, ljea patlu a tãu sh-fudz!’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Ma tra si-shtits cã Hiljilu-a omlui ari puteari sã-ljeartã amãrtiili pri loc, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>mini ma ts-dzãcã: ‘Scoalã-ti, ljea patlu shi imnã la casa a ta!’” <verse eid="MRK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Shi elu si sculã dinãoarã, lo patlu a lui, shi inshi afoarã dininti a tutlor, shi ashã tuts s-ciudisirã shi alãvdarã Dumnidzãulu dzãcãnda: “Unã ahtari thavmã nu u-avem vidzut pute!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Acljimarea al Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Isus inshi nãpoi mardzina di amari shi multsãmea yinea la nãs shi elu lã-nvitsa. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Trãcãnda vidzu Levilu, hiljilu al Alfeul apunat iu s-pãltea taxa, sh-lji dzãsi: “Urmeadz-mi!” Sh-elu si sculã shi s-dusi dupã nãs.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Sh-ma nãpoi cãnd Isusul eara la measã la casa a Levilui, mults taxidãri shi amãrtioshlji shãdea la measã cu Isusul sh-cu ucenitsilji a lui, cã eara mults atselj tsi nãdzea dupã nãs. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Atumtsea scriblji shi Fariseilji, cãndu vidzurã cã ma mãca deadun cu taxidãrlji shi amãrtioshlji, lã-dzãsirã a ucenitsilor a lui: “Cum mãcã sh-bea elu deadun cu taxidãrlji shi amãrtioshlji?” <verse eid="MRK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Sh-Isusul cãndu li avdzã, lã-dzãsi a lor: “Nu sãntu sãnãtoshlji tsi au ananghi ti iatrulu, ma lãndzitslji. Mini nu vinj s-acljemã ndreptsilji, ma amãrtioshlji trã mitãnjiusiri.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nvitsãtura Atsea Noaua al Isus shi Traditsia Atsea Veaclja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Atumtsea ucenitsilji al Ioan shi al Fariseilor tsãnea pãreasinji. Atselji vinirã la Isusul shi lj-ntribarã: “Cãtse ucenitsilji al Ioan shi atselji al Fariseilor tsãnã pãreasinji, shi ucenitsilji a tãlj nu tsãn pãreasinji?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Shi Isusul rãspunsi atsilor: “Poati s-tsãnã preasinji acljimatsilji pi numtã cãndu dzinirlu easti cu nãsh? Di cãt chiro dzinirlu easti cu nãsh nu poatã s-tsãnã preasinji! <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Ma va s-yinã dzãlili cãndu va s-hibã loatã dzinirlu di nãsh, shi atumsea tu atseali dzãli elji va s-tsãnã pãreasinji. <verse eid="MRK 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>Nitsunã nu bagã tu un stranji veclju un peticu nou, cã altã soi lu arupi stranjilu shi azmuldzearea s-fatsi ma marã. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Tutã ashã nitsunã nu bagã yinu nou tu foali veachli, altã soi yinlu nou aspardzi foalili, yinlu s-vearsi shi foalili chearã, ashã cã yinlu atselu nou s-bagã tu foali nali.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isus, Domnul a Sãmbãtãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Shi undzi tsi unã dzuã di Sãmbãtã elu ma tritsea anamisa di agri siminati, shi trãcãnda ucenitsilji a lui arupea schipuri. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Shi Fariseilji lji-dzãsirã: “Vedzã, cãtse lu facã aestã tsi nu prindi s-lu facã dzua di Sãmbãtã?” <verse eid="MRK 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Shi elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Ma nu avets ghivãsitã tu Scriturili tsi featsi Davidul, cãndu avea ananghi shi agiuna, elu shi tuts alantsilji tsi eara cu nãs? <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Elu intrã tu casa al Dumnidzãu tu chirolu a arhipreftului Abiatar, shi mãcã pãnjili di dininti, tsi nu prindi s-li mãca nitsunã, ma singru dicãt preftsãlji, shi elu lã deadi sh-atsilor tsi eara cu nãs.” <verse eid="MRK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Deapoea lã dzãsi atsilor: “Sãmbãta easti fãptã ti omlu, sh-nu omlu ti Sãmbãta.” <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Trã atsea Hiljilu a omlui easti domn sh-a Sãmbãtãljei.<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Omlu cu Mãna Uscat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Deapoea elu intrã tu sinagogã, shi aclo eara un om cu mãna uscatã. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Niscãntsã lu viglja Isusul macã va lu vindica dzua di Sãmbãtã, shi deapoea s-lu vãrgheascã. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Elu lji-dzãsi a omlui cu mãna uscatã: “Scoalã-ti namisa a tutlor!” <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Shi elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Tsi easti ndrept dzua di Sãmbãtã, s-fatsã ghini icã s-fatsã arãu, sã-ascachi un suflit icã su-vatsãnjã?” Ma elji tãtsea. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Atumtsea elu, cum li vidzu anvãrliga cu inati, shi nvirinat cã ininjli a lor eara indiferenti, lji dzãsi a omlui: “Tindã mãna!” Elu u timsi shi mãna a lui s-featsi ca alanta sãnãtoasã. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Sh-Fariseilji inshirã afoarã shi trãoarã apofasirã cu Herodianjilji contra a lui, cum su-vatãmã.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Aleapsi Di Doisprãdzatsilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Isusul cu ucenitsilji a lui s-dusi cãtrã amari shi unã multsãmi mari di oaminj dit Galilea shi dit Iudea lu-urmã, <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>sh-dit Ierusalim, sh-dit Idumea, sh-di napãrti di Iordan, tutashã unã multsãmi mari di avãrliga di Tiro sh-di Sidon. Cãndu avdzãrã atseali lucri mãri tsi elu fãtsea, vinirã la nãs. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Sh-elu lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui sã-aibã totãna etimu unã varcã, tsi laolu si nu-u pindzea. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Elu avea vindicatã mults oaminj, tuts tsi avea lãngoari s-aduna anvãrliga di nãsu s-bãga mãna pi nãs. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Shi duhurili nicurati anda u-videa cãdea pi dintsi dininti a lui shi aurla dzãcãnda: “Tini eshti Hiljilu al Dumnidzãu!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Ma elu lji vãrghea tsi s-nu spunea cai eara elu.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Blãstimarea a Fariseilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Deapoea elu s-alinã pri munti, shi acljimã aproapi di nãsu atselji tsi vrea. Shi elji vinirã la nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Shi elu aleapsi doisprãdzatsi (tsi s-acljima apostulji), s-hibã cu nãsu shi s-li pitritsea sã predica, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>shi s-avea puteari s-aĝuneascã dratsilji. <verse eid="MRK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Shi ia doisprãdzatsilji: Simonulu, a cui lj bãgã numa Petru, <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>Iacovul, hiljilu al Zebedeu, shi Ioani, fratili al Iacov, tsi lã bãgã numa Boanerges, tsi va s-dzãcã hiljilji a bubunidzariljei. <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Andrea, Filip, Bartolomeu, Matei, Toma, Iacovul, hiljilu al Alfeu, Tadeu, shi Simon Cananeas, <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>shi Iuda Iscariotul, tsi ma nãpoi lu vindu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Familia al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Apoea intrarã la unã casã. Shi s-adunã unã multsãmi marã cãt nitsi pãni nu putea s-mãca. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Shi cãndu soea a lui lo di hãbari, s-dusi su-ljea, cã dzãtsea: “Nu easti ghini di minti.” <verse eid="MRK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Iarã scribilji tsi avea dipunatã dit Ierusalim, dzãtsea: “Elu ari Buelzebubul sh-li aĝuneashti dratsilji cu aestu printsilu a dratsilor.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Ma elu li-acljimã aproapi di nãsu shi lã gri cu parabolã: “Cum poati Satanlu su aĝuneascã Satanlu? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Ma cã unã amirãrilj dit nãuntru easti mpãrtsãtã, atsea amirãrilje nu poati s-bãneadzã. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Ma cã unã casã dit nãuntru sã-mpartsã, atsea casã nu poati s-bãneadzã. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Ashã, macã Satanlu si-scoalã contra ali sinli a lui, shi easti pãrtsãt, nu poati si s-tsãnã, ma s-bitiseashti icã cheari. <verse eid="MRK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>Nitsiun nu-poati s-intrã tu casa a omlui fãrtos shi s-lju arãcheascã avearea a lui, ni lãgatã ma nãinti omlu atsel fãrtoslu, atumtsea poati s-lju afurã casa. <verse eid="MRK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã a omnjilor va s-hibã ljirtati itsi amãrtii shi cathe blãstem tsi va s-dzãcã. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Ma di atselu tsi va s-blãsteamã contra a Duhlui Sãmtu nu va s-aibã ljirtari di totãna. Elu easti amãrtios ti eta tutã.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Isusul li dzãsi aesti cã elji dzãtsea: “Elu ari un duh nicurat!”<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Familia al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Tu oara atsea vinirã fratsilji a lui shi muma, shi stãnda afoarã, pitricurã sh-lji grirã. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Multsãmea eara apunat avãrliga di nãsu, shi-lji dzãsirã: “Ia, muma shi fratsilji a tãlji, sãntu nafoarã sh-ma ti caftã.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Ma elu apãndisi a lor dzãcãnda: “Cai easti muma-a mea icã fratsilji a melji?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Daepoea, mutrinda avãrliga di atselji tsi shãdea ningã nãsu, dzãsi: “Ia, muma-a mea shi fratsilji-a melji! <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Cã, caitsido tsi fatsi vrearea al Dumnidzãu, elu easti fratili-a meu, sora-a mea shi muma.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Simnãtorlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Deapoea Isusul apãrnji sã-nveatsã mardzina di amari. Shi avãrliga di nãsu s-adunã un multsãmi mari di oaminj, cãt elu intrã tu varcã shi-shãdea pi nãsã, shi tutã multsãmea eara mardzina di amari. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Shi elu lã nvitsa a lor cu paraboli multi lucruri, shi tu nvitsãtura-a lui lu dzãsi: <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>“Ascultats! Ia, inshi siminãtorlu sã seaminã. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Shi cãndu elu simina, nãscãnti gãrãts a farãljei cãdzurã pi cali shi puljilji a tserlui vinirã sh-li mãcarã. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Shi nihiam a farãljie cãdzu pi loc chitros, iu nu avea multã tsarã shi deadi dinãoarã, cã nu avea tsarã ãhãndoasã. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Ma cãndu inshi soarili s-pãlirã shi ti atsea, tsi nu avea rãdãtsinã s-uscã. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Shi un parti a farãljei cãdzu namisã di schinj, schinjilji criscurã, ljã acãtsarã anasa shi nu deadi carpo. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Unã altã parti cãdzu pi tsarã bunã, shi deadi carpo tsi crishtea shi adusi: unã treidzãtsi, alanta shaidzãtsi, shi alanta unã sutã.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Deapoea elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Cai ari urechlji trã avdzãri, s-avdã.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Cãndu Isusul eara singur, atselji tsi eara avãrliga di nãsu deadun cu doisprãdzatslji, lu ntribarã trã parabola. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Elu lã dzãsi a lor: “A voauã vã easti datã s-cunushtets mistirĝiul a amirãriljei al Dumnidzãu, iarã atsilor tsi sãntu afoarã tuti aesti sã si da cu paraboli:<verse eid="MRK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>
    <char style="it">‘Mutrinda, s-veadã ma s-nu bagã oarã,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="it">shi avdzãnda, s-avdã ma s-nu aducheascã,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="it">cã s-nu mitanjuseascã</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="it">shi amãrtiili s-ljeartã.’</char>”<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Explicarea a Paraboljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Deapoea u dzãsi a lor: “Nu u-aduchits aestã parabolã? Ma atumtsea cum va li aduchits tuti alanti paraboli? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Siminãtorlu seaminã Zborlu. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Atselji ningã cali sãntu atselji pri la cai si seaminã zborlu, ma dupã tsi u-avdzãrã atsea, yini trãoarã Satanlu shi lã-scoati sborlu siminatã la nãshi. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Tutashã atselji tsi u-ljea fara pri chetri, sãntu atselji tsi cãndu lu avdzãrã zborlu, trãoarã u ljea cu harauã, <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>ma tsi nu acãtsarã rãdãtsinã pri nãshi, shi sãntã ti putsãn chiro, shi cãndu yini zorea icã avinarea trã itia a-zborlui, si-scandalizescu trãoarã. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Atselji cai u-ljea fara namisa di scinj, sãntu atselji tsi lu-ascultã zborlu, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>ma nvirinãrili-a ashtiei eti, arãdearili-a averilor, shi mania ti alti lucri tsi ljã intrã a omului, astupu sborlu shi nu da carpo. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Iarã atselji tsi u loarã fara tu tsarã bunã, sãntu atselji tsi lu ascultã sborlu, u ljea shi aducã carpo: unlu treidzãts, altu shaidzãts shi altu unã sutã.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Lambãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Deapoea lã dzãsi a lor: “Vahi s-bagã lamba sum un gãleatã icã sum un pat? Nu si s-bagã pri purtãtorul ali lunjini? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Cã nu ari tsiva ascumtu tsi s-nu s-dizvileascã, shi tsiva faptu pri ascumtu tsi s-nu easã tu lunjinã. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Cai ari ureclji ti avdzãri, s-avdã!” <verse eid="MRK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Shi lã dzãsi a lor: “Bãgats oarã atsea tsi avdzãtsã. Cu atsea misurã tsi voi misurats, va vã si misurã, shi a voauã tsi avdzãts va vã si da ma multu. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Cã atsilui tsi ari va lji si da, ma atsilui tsi nu ari va lji si ljea shi atsea tsi ari.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Simintsãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Isusul dzãsi: “Amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu easti ca un om tsi arucã simintsa pri loc. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Noaptea shi dzua, cãndu elu doarmi shi si scoalã, simintsa fitruseashti shi creashti, fãrã si shtibã elu cum. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Di singur loclu lu fatsi: ma nãinti curpanlu, sh-apoea schiclu, shi tu soni schiclu cu gãrnutsi. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Iarã cãndu carpolu s-coatsi, trãoarã s-bagã seatsira, cã yini oara di sitsirari.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Simintsãljei di Sinap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Elu dzãsi: “Cu tsi undzeashti amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu? Icã cu tsi parabolã su-aspunem? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Ea undzeashti cu simintsea di sinap tsi easti siminat tu loc. Atsea simintsã easti ma njicã pri loc. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Ma dupã tsi si seaminã, creashti shi s-fatsi ma mari di tuti zãrzãvãtsile, shi sãlgheashti alumãchi ahãti mãri cãt puljilji a tserlui poatã s-aflã streahã sum aumbra a lor.” <verse eid="MRK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Shi cu multi ahtãri paraboli lã spunea a lor sborlu, ashã cum elji putea s-lu achicãsea. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Shi nu lã grea a lor fãrã paraboli, iarã a ucenitsilor a lui ahoria, lã spunea itsido.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul shi Furtuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Tu seara a aishtei dzuã, lã dzãsi a lor: “Tritsem pi alantã parti.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Shi ucenitsilji, cum u nchisirã multsãmea, u loarã Isusul ashã cum eara tu varcã. Cu nãsu eara sh-nãscãnti varchi njitsi. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Tu oarã aestã si s-featsi unã furtunã mari shi vãljiurili s-plãscãnea pri varcã ahãt multã cãt ea ma s-umplea. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Iarã elu durnjea tu varcã pri unã cãpitinj. Elji lu dishtiptarã shi lji dzãsirã: “Nvitsãtore nu ai mirachi trã noi cã ma ni nicãm?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Shi elu cum si dishtiptã lji aurlã a vimtului shi lji gri ali amari: “Tãtsã shi isihãsea-ti!” Shi vimtulu pãpsi shi s-featsi isihii mari. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Shi lã dzãsi a lor: “Cãtse hits ahãnt fricoshi? Cum nu avets pisti?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Shi atselji li acãtsã unã fricã mari shi dzãtsea un cu-alantu: “Cai easti aesti tsi lu ascultã shi vimtulu shi amarea?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Demonizatul Gadarean</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Ashã agiumsirã tu alantã parti a amarãljei tu locurili a Gherasenjilor. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Shi macãt Isusul dipunã dit varcã, trãoarã lji inshi nãinti dit murmintul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">murmintul </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Easti una guvã tãljat tu chieatrã, iu Ideilji li bãga mortsili a lor.</char></note> un om umplut cu un duh nicurat, <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>elu bãna tu murmintsã shi nitsiunã nu avea putut s-lu liga cu singir. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Di multi ori lu avea ligatã cu prãnghi shi singir, ma elu totãna l-frãndzea singirili shi li arupea prãnghili, shi nitsiunã nu putea s-lu imireadzã. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Dipriunã noaptea shi dzua, prit murmints shi prit muntsi, tritsea aurlãnda shi tãljãnda truplu a lui cu chetri. <verse eid="MRK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Cãndu elu lu vidzu Isusul di diparti, imnã shi s-ncljinã dininti a lui. <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>Shi cu unã aurlari mari dzãsi: “Tsi ari namisa di noi shi di tini, Isus, Hiljilu al Dumnidzãu atsel multu analtu? Mini ti giurã pi numa al Dumnidzãu, nu mi pidipsea!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Cã Isusul lji-avea dzãsã: “Duh nicurat, eshi dit aestu om!” <verse eid="MRK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Atumtsea Isusul lu ntribã: “Cai easti numa a ta?” Shi elu apãndisi dzãcãnda: “Mini mi acljeamã Legion, cãtse him multsã.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Shi l-pãrãcãlsea multu tsi si nu li aĝuneascã dit loclu atselu. <verse eid="MRK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Aclo la coasta a muntilui eara unã cupiã mari di portsi tsi pãshtea. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Atumtsea tuts demonjili pãrãcãlsirã dzãcãndã: “Pitreatsi-nã la portsi tsi s-intrãm tu nãshi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Shi Isusul trãoarã u deadi izini a lor, shi duhurili nicurati dupã tsi inshirã, intrarã la portsilji, shi cupia s-arucã nghios di tu ripã tu amari. Era aproapi doauã njilji di capiti tsi s-nicarã tu amari.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Shi atselji tsi pãshtea portsilji fudzirã shi u scurpisirã shtirea tu cãsãbã sh-pri hoari. Sh-oaminjli vinirã sã videa tsi avea undzitã. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Cãndu vinirã la Isus, vidzurã drãcuitlu mpadi, nviscut shi cu mintea ntreag, atselu tsi eara demonizat di leghionlu, shi avea fricã. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Shi atselji tsi u avea vidzutã, lji spusirã a lor cã tsi lji avea undzitã a demonizatlui shi a portsilor. <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Atumsina atselji ahurhirã s-lji pãrãcãlseascã al Isus s-fugã di sinurili a lor. <verse eid="MRK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Cãndu elu ma intra tu varcã, atselu tsi eara demonizatã lji pãrãcãlsea tsi s-putea s fudzea cu nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Ma Isusul nu lji deadi izini, shi lj-dzãsi: “Imnã la casa a ta, la-a tãlji shi spunã atsilor tsi lucruri mãri featsi Domnul shi cum ti njilui.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Shi elu fudzi shi ahurhi sã predica pri regiunea di Decapolis di tuti atseali tsi avea faptã Isusul shi tuts s-ciudisirã.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muljearea cu Curarea di Sãndzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Shi cãndu Isus tricu nãpoi tu alantã parti cu varcã, un multsãmi marã s-adunã avãrliga di nãsu, shi elu armasi mardzina di amari. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Deapoea vini un di ma mãrlji a sinagogãljei, cu numa Iair, tsi cãndu lu vidzu, lj-cãdzu la cicioari. <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>Shi multu lã pãrãcãlsi dzãcãnda: “Hiljea a mea ma moari, haidi shi bagã mãnjili pri nãsã, tsi s-vindicã shi s-bãneadzã.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Shi elu s-dusi cu nãs, shi unã multsãmi mari nidzea dupã nãs shi s-pindzea avãrliga di nãs. <verse eid="MRK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Namisa di nãshi eara unã muljeari tsi lj-cura sãndzili di doisprãdzatsi di anji. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Shi avea traptã multi di partea a iatsrilor shi avea chirutã tutã avearea a ljei fãrã ambunãsiri, ninga ma s-fãtsea ma rãu. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Cãndu avdzã si zbura di Isusul, intrã la multsãmea, sh-dupã nãs timsi mãna la stranjilu al Isus. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Ea dzãtsea: “Macã va bagã mãna la stranjili a lui, va mi vindicã.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Sh-trãoarã curarea a sãndzilui pãpsi shi ea sãmtsã tu truplu a ljei cã s-vindicã di atsea lãngoari. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Ma trãoarã Isusul sãmtsã un puteari tsi avea ishit di la nãsu, s-turnã cãtrã multsãmea sh-dzãsi: “Cai deadi di stranjili a meali?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Shi ucenitsilji a lui lji-dzãsirã: “Nu vedz cã multsãmea ma s-pingã di tuti pãrtsãli shi tini dzãtsi: ‘Cai deadi di mini?’” <verse eid="MRK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Elu mutrea avãrliga s-videa cai u featsi aestã. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Atumtsea, muljearea mplinã di fricã sh-trimurãnda, cã shtia tsi avea pãtsãtã, vini shi lji cãdzu pi cicioari shi lj-spusi tutã alihea. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Shi elu lj-dzãsi: “Hiljã, pistipsirea a ta ti-vindicã, imnã tu pace cã eshti vindicatã di lãngoarea a ta!”<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiljea al Iair</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Iarã Isusul ninga ma grea, vinirã niscãntsi di la casa a primarului a sinagogãljei dzãcãndã: “Hjiljea a ta muri. Cãtse lu cãrteshti ninga nvitsãtorlu?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Ma Isusul cãndu avdzã tsi dzãsirã, lji dzãsi a primarului a sinagogãljei: “Nu ti asparã, mashi s-ai pistusini!” <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Nu alãsã s-lu urmeadzã nitsiun altã, dicãt mashi Petrul, Iacovul shi Ioanul, fratli al Iacov. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Shi dupã cum agiumsi la casa a marlui a sinagogãljei, vidzu unã mintiturã mari shi oaminji tsi plãndzea shi vãita cu boatsã. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Intrã sh-u dzãsi a lor: “Cãtse aurlats shi plãndzets? Feata nu muri, ma doarmi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Sh-elji lu mpizuirã, ma elu dupã tsi li scoasi tuts afoarã, lo cu nãs tat-su shi mã-sa-a li feati sh-atselji tsi eara cu nãsã, sh-intrã aclo iu eara feata. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Shi u lo feata di mãnã shi lj-dzãsi: “Talitha kumi”, tsi va s-dzacã: “Featã, atsãia ma tsã-dzãc: Scoalã-ti!” <verse eid="MRK 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Shi trãoarã feata si sculã shi imnã singur. Ea eara di doisprãdzatsi di anji. Sh-elji s-ciudisirã multã. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Ma elu lã deadi ordin tsi nitsiunã s-nu shtia. Sh-lã ursi si lj-da ali feati di mãcari.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Isus Ni-apruchiat tu Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Apoea Isusul fudzi di aclo shi vini tu tsara a lui, shi ucenitsilji a lui u urmarã. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Shi cãndu vini Sãmbãta, ahurhi sã li nvitsa tu sinagogã. Shi multsã cãndu lu-avdza, s-ciudisea shi dzãtsea: “Di iu lj-yinã aishtui aesti? Tsi mintiminiljii easti atsea tsi lj-easti datã? Shi cum s-facã aesti thavmati cu mãnjili a lui? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Nu easti aestu lemnar, hiljilu ali Marii, fratili al Iacov, shi al Iose, al Iuda shi al Simon? Shi nu sãntu aoa namisa di noi surãrili a lui?” Shi si scandalizeascu ti itia a lui. <verse eid="MRK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Nitsiunu prufit nu easti dispretsuit dicãt mashi tu patria a lui, tu soia a lui sh-tu casa a lui.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Shi nu pãtu s-facã atsia nitsiunã thavmã, dicãt mashi s-vindicã vãrãndoi lãndzitsã bãgãnda mãna pri nãshi. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Shi s-ciudisea ti nipistusirea a lor. Isusul imna avãrliga pri hoarili shi li-nvitsa.<verse eid="MRK 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Misionul a Doisprãdzãtsilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Sh-li acljimã atselji doisprãdzatsi shi ahurhi s-lji pitreacã doi cãti doi sh-u deadi puteari pristi duhurili nicurati. <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>Sh-lã dimãndã s-nu ljea tsiva altã pri cali, dicãt mashi unã ciumagã, nitsi trastã, nitsi pãni, nitsi pãradzi tu brãn, <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Ma s-ncalcã mash sandalili shi s-nu bagã doauã pãreclji di tunicã. <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Shi lã dsãsi ninga: “Iutsido tsi s-intrats tu unã casã, armãnets aclo pãnã s-fudzit di aclo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Macã niscãntsi nu vã ashteaptã shi nu vã avdã, cãndu s-fudzits di aclo, ascuturats puhlu dit cicioarili-a voastri, ca mãrtirii contra-a lor. [Dealihea vã dzãc cã dzua a giudicarãljei Sodoma shi Gomora va si s-veadã cu ma multã lishuredz dicãt atselu i think socãsãbã.]”<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Ashã atselji s-dusirã shi-u predica a oamnjilor tsi s-mitãnjiuseascã <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Shi aĝuneascã mults demonji shi aungã cu untulem mults lãndzitsã shi-li vindica.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Moartea al Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Tora amirãlu Herod avdzã si sbura di Isusul cã numa a lui eara faptã cunuscut shi elu dzãsi: “Ioan pãtidzãtorlu s-inje dit mortsã, trã atsea pri nãsu ma lucreazdzã putearili cu mari ciudii.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Niscãntsã altsã dzãtsea: “Easti Ilia.” Shi niscãnts altsã dzãtsea: “Easti un prufit icã un di prufitsilji.” <verse eid="MRK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Ma cãndu Herodul li avdzã tuti atseali, dzãsi: “A Ioanlui, u cui lji tãljai caplu, s-inje dit mortsã.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Cã Herodul avea datã ordin s-acãtsa Ioanulu shi s-tsãnea ligatã tu hapsi ti itia a Herodiadãljei, muljeara al Filip, fratli a lui, cãtse lu avea loatã ti muljearã. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Ioanlu lj-dzitsea al Herod: “Nu ai ndreptate s-ai muljearea a fratilui a tãu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Shi Herodiada lu aura shi vrea s-lu vãtãma, ma nu putea. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Herodul s-afirea di Ioanlu tsi lu cunushtea ca om ndrept shi sãmtã, shi lu apãra, shi dupã tsi avdza multi lucri di nãsu, fãtsea multi lucri, shi lu asculta cu vreari. <verse eid="MRK 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Ma vini dzua tsi lipsea shi Herodul, tu dzua a amintariljei a lui adãrã uspetsi ti mãrilji a lui, capitãnjilji shi tinjisitsilji a Galileiljei. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Intrã hiljea a Herodiadãljei, giucã sh-lji arãsi al Irod shi a lor tsi shidea deadun cu nãsu la measã, atumtsea amirãlu lji-dzãsi a featiljei: “Caftã-nji itsi vrei shi mini va tsã dau.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Shi lji si spigiurã: “Itsido tsi va nji caftsã va tsã dau, pãn la giumitatea a amirãriljei-a mea.” <verse eid="MRK 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Ea inshi afoarã sh-lji dsãsi a mumãljei: “Tsi prindi s-lji caftã?” Shi ea apãndisi: “Caplu al Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu!” <verse eid="MRK 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Ea s-turnã trãoarã la amirãlu shi lji-cãftã aĝonjea: “Mini voi tsi tini s-nji dai trãoarã tu tãpsii caplu al Ioan Pitidzãtorlu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Shi amirãlu cu tutã cã s-nvirinã multã di aestã, nu vrea s-arnisea ti itia cã eara spigiuratã shi ti tinjia a acljimatsilor. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Ashã trãoarã amirãlu pitricu unã avigljitor s-lji aducã caplu al Iaon. <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>Shi elu s-dusi tu hapsi, lj-tãljã caplu shi lji lu-adusi pri unã tãpsii, lji lu deadi ali feati shi feata lju deadi a mumãljei. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Cãndu ucenitsilji al Ioan li avdzãrã aesti, vinirã, loarã truplu a lui shi lu bãgarã tu murmintu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Prota Multsirea a Pãnjilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Tora apostoljilji s-adunarã ningã Isus shi lji spusirã tuti atseali tsi avea faptã shi tsi lj-avea nvitsatã. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Shi elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Haidets tu un loc tu irnjii shi discurmats-vã.” Cã oamnjilji tsi yinea shi s-dutsea eara ahãnt multsã cãt nu avea chiro di mãcari.<verse eid="MRK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>S-nchisirã cu unã varcã cãtrã un loc ermu shi dipãrtat. <verse eid="MRK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Ma cãt multsãmea lã vidzu tsi s-nchisirã, multsi di atselji lu cunuscurã, sh-di tuti cãsãbadzli vinirã aclo pi cicioari shi agiumsirã dininti a lor shi s-adunarã avãrliga di nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Cãndu Isus inshi dit varcã, vidzu unã multsãmi marã shi ljã-vini rãu, cã era ca oili fãrã picurar. Shi ahurhi s-lã nveatsã multã lucri. <verse eid="MRK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Shi cum tricu mult chiro, ucenitsilji a lui s-apruchearã shi lji-dzãsirã: “Aestu loc easti ermu shi tora easti amãnatã. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Dã-lã cali aishtoru oaminji si s-ducã tu cãmpurili shi hoarili di avãrliga tsi s-acumpãrã pãni, cã nu au tsiva ti mãcari.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Iar elu apãndisinda lã dzãsi a lor: “Dats-lã voi s-mãcã!” Shi elji lji-dzãsirã: “Prindi s-nidzem noi s-acumpãrãm cu doauã sutã di denari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">200 di denari easti ma putsãn di plãtirea a unui an.</char></note> shi s-lã dãm ti mãcari?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Shi elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Cãt pãnji avets? Imnats-vã shi mutrits!” Dupã cã vidzurã dzãsirã: “Tsintsi pãnji sh-doi peshtsã.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Atumtsea elu deadi ordinã a lor tsi s-li ndreagã tuts, apunats pi grupuri pri yiarba veardã. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Ashã atselji s-apunarã tu grupuri cãti unã sutã sh-cãti tsindzãtsi. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Apoea elu lo tsintsi pãnjili shi doi peshtsãlji, sculã ochljilji cãtrã tser, ghinicuvãntã, li pãrtsã panjili sh-u deadi a ucenitsilor a lui, tsi s-u pãrtsa a lor, tutashã u pãrtsã a lor shi peshtsãlji. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Tuts mãcarã pãn s-fãntirã <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Shi adunarã doisprãdzatsi di cãneastri cu sãrmi di pãnji shi cu armãnturi di peshtsã. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Atselji tsi mãcarã pãnjili eara tsintsi njiljã di bãrbats.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isus Imnã Pristi Apã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Trãoarã Isusul lã ursi ucenitsilji a lui s-intra tu varcã shi si s-ducã tu alantã parti cãtrã Betsaida, pãn-cãnd elu s-alãsa s-dispãrtsea mutsãmea. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Macãt li salutã, elu s-alinã tu munti ti pãrãcãlsiri.<verse eid="MRK 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Cãndu tunicã varca eara namisa di amari shi elu singur eara pri uscatã. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Cãndu li vidzu ucenitsilji, elji ma s-pidipsea nãftãnda, cã yinea vintu contra lor. Tu a patrulu avigljitor a noaptãljei Isusul s-nchisi cãtrã nãshi imnãnda pri amari shi elu vrea s-li tritsea. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Ma elji, cãndu lu-vidzurã cã ma tritsea pri amari, mintuirã cã eara unã fantazmã shi ahurhirã sã aurlã. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Cã tuts lu vidzurã shi eara lãhtãrsitsã, ma elu trãoarã ahurhi s-greascã cu nãshi, sh-dsãsi: “Curaiu! Mini escu, nu vã-aspãrats!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Dapoea s-alinã tu varcã cu nãshi shi vimtul pãpsi. Shi atselji armasirã ciudisits shi si thãvmãtisirã. <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>Cã nu lu-avea aduchitã thavma a pãnjilor cãtse inima a lor eara chitrisitã. <verse eid="MRK 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Dupã tsi tricurã, agiumsirã tu loclu a Ghenezaretlui, shi aclo u-ligarã varca. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Shi cãndu ishirã dit varcã, oaminjilji lu-cunuscurã dinãoarã. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Shi trãcãnda trãoarã pisti tutã locurili di avãrligã, ahurhirã s-aducã tuts lãndzitsilji pri paturi iutsido tsi avdza cã s-afla. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Shi iutsido tsi elu yinea, tu hoari, tu cãsãbadz icã tu mãhãladz oaminjilji bãga lãndzitslji tu padi, shi lu pãrãcãlsea tsi s-bãga mãna pi stranjili a lui. Sh-tuts atselji tsi bãgarã mãna s-vindicarã.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Nvitsarea ti Cãtrãsirea di Nãuntru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Atumtsea s-adunarã avãrliga di nãsu fariseilji shi niscãntsã scribi tsi avea vinitã di Ierusalim. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Atselji bãgarã oarã cã niscãntsã di ucenitsilji a lui ma mãca pãni cu mãnjili lãvushiti, va s-dzãcã nilati. <verse eid="MRK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Fariseilji shi tuts Iudeilji nu mãcã nilati ghini mãnjili ma nãinti, tsãnãnda adetsili a vecljilor. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Shi cãndu s-toarnã dit pãzari nu mãcã nilatã ma nãinti. Suntu multi alti lucri tsi atselji prindi s-li fac ti itia a adetsilor: larea a cupilor, a pocilor, a cãldãrilor shi a paturilor.<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Dapoea Fariselji shi scriblji lu ntribarã: “Cãtse ucenitsilji a tãlji nu facã dupã adetsili a vecljilor, ma mãcã pãni ni aspãlati mãnjili?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Ma elu apãndisinda lã dzãsi a lor: “Ghini prufitipsi Isaia trã voi, ipucrits, ashã cum easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="it">‘Aestu popul cu budzili mi tinjiseashti,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="it">ma inima-a lor easti diparti di mini.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>
    <char style="it">Ma di geaba mi alãvdatsã,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="it">nvitsãnda unã doctrinã tsi easti unã dimãndari umineascã.’</char><verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>Alãsãnda di unã parti ordinlu al Dumnidzãu, ma tsinets adetsili a oamnjilor, aspãlarea a pocilor shi a cupilor, shi fãtsets multi alti ahtãri lucri.” <verse eid="MRK 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Shi ninga lã dzãsi a lor: “Voi hits axii ti arnisiri oridinlu al Dumnidzãu, shi di tsãneari adetulu a vostru. <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Moisiul dzãsi: <char style="it">‘Tinjisea tatãlu a tãu shi muma a ta.’</char> Shi: <char style="it">‘Atselu tsi blastimã tatãlu shi muma, easti giudicatã cu moarti.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Ma voi dzitsets: ‘Macã vãrã lji-dzãtsi a-tatãlui a lui icã ali mumi a lui, itsi pot s-facã trã voi easti un Curban, va s-dzãcã un pishchesh trã Dumnidzãulu,’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>nu lu alãsats atselu s-facã tsiva di tatãlu a lui icã di muma a lui, <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>ashi arnisãnda zborlu al Dumnidzãlu cu adetulu a vostru, tsi voi lu avets clirunumsitã. Shi voi ma fãtsets multi alti ahtãri lucri.” <verse eid="MRK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Dapoea acljimã tutã lumea avãrliga di nãs shi lji-dzãsi: “Mi ascultats tuts shi aduchits! <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Nu ari tsiva dit nafoarã a omlui, tsi intrãnda tu nãsu s-u lãvãshescu, aljiumtrea sãntu atseli lucri tsi easã di la nãsu tsi u lãvãshescu.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>[Cai ari ureclji trã avdzãri, s-avdã!]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aestu stih nu s-aflã tu itsi manuscrisã grãtseascã.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Ma napoea, cãndu elu s-turnã la casã, diparti di multsãmea, ucenitsilji a lui lu-ntribarã trã achicãsirea a parabolãljei. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Shi elu lã-dzãsi a lor: “Shi voi nu avets minti n-capã. Nu-u aduchitsã cã itsi intrã di nafoarã la omlu nu poati s-u lãvãsheascã? <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Cãtse nu lji-intrã tu inimã, ma tu pãnticã, shi deapoea lu-scoatã tu tualet?” Zburãnda ashi, elu li declarã curati tuti mãcãrili.<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Elu dzãsi: “Atsea tsi easi di la omlu, lu fatsi lãvos. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Cã di nãuntru, va s-dzãcã dit inima a-omlui ies mintuirili arãli, ncãlcarea a cãruniljei, furãrili, vãtãmãrile, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>putãnãsirili, maniilji, ruteatsili, arãdearili, rushinirea, pizma, blãstemlu, mintimãrirea, hãzãmãrili. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Tuti atseli arãli ies din nãuntru sh-u lãvãshescu omlu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muljerea Siro-Fenicianã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Deapoea s-nchisi dit aclo shi s-dusi tu cãsãbãulu a Tirlui. Intrã tu unã casã sh-vrea tsi nitsiun s-nu lu shtibã, ma nu putu s-armãnã ascumtu. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Unã muljearã, tsi hiljea a ljei avea un duh nicuratã, avdzãnda di Isusul, vini sh-cãdzu la cicioarili a lui. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Tora atsea muljearã eara elenicã, cu rãdãtsinã Sirofenicã. Shi lji pãrãcãlsi a lui tsi s-lu aĝunea draclu di hilja a ljei. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Iarã Isusul dzãsi: “Alasã cilimenjilji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">cilimenjilji </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vrea s-dzãc cilimenjilji a Israelui, shi cãtsãlji a cãnjilor va s-dzãc nu-iudenjilji.</char></note> prota s-fãnteascã, cãtse nu easti ghini s-ljeai pãnea a-cilimenjilor shi s-u arutsã a cãtsãljilor.” <verse eid="MRK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Ma ea apãndisi shi lj-dzãsi: “Ghini ma greshtã, Doamne, ma shi cãtsãljilji sum masã mãcã sãrmili a cilimenjilor!” <verse eid="MRK 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Atumtsea elu lj-dzãsi: “Trã aestu sbor a tãu, fudzã, draclu ishi di hiljea a-ta!” <verse eid="MRK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Sh-ea, cãndu s-turnã la casa a-ljei, u-aflã feata tu pat shi draclu avea ishitã.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vindicarea a Mutului dit Decapolis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Dupã tsi s-nchisi nãpoi dit locurli a Tirlui shi s-dusi cãtrã Sidonlu, Isusul agiumsi la amarea a Galileiljei, namisa di loclu a Decapolei. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Sh-lji adusirã un mut tsi cu zori grea, shi lj-pãrãcãlsirã s-bagã mãnjili pi nãsu s-lu vindica.<verse eid="MRK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Cum u dipãrtã, diparti dit multsãmea, lj-bãgã dzeadzitli tu urecljilji a lui, shi dupã tsi lã scuchiã dzeaditlu, lj-acãtsã limba. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Dapoea sculã ocljilji cãtrã tser, suschirã shi-lj dzãsi: “Effatha”, tsi va s-dzãcã: “Discljidi-ti!” <verse eid="MRK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Shi trãoarã s-discljisirã urechljilji shi s-dizligã gura shi elu gri cum prinde.<verse eid="MRK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Sh-Isusul lã-ursi atselji tsi s-nu lj-spunea a vãrui. Ma cãt ma multu lã ursea ahtãt ma multu elji lu scurpisea sborlu. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Shi multu ciudisits, dzãtsea: “Elu itsido lu ari faptã ghini, tsi surdzãlji s-avdã shi mutsilji s-greascã!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Multsirea a Doila a Pãnjilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Tu atseali dzãli, s-adunã unã multsãmi multu mari sh-nu avea tsi s-mãca, Isusul lã-gri a ucenitsilor sh-lã dzãsi a lor: <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>“Nj-easti njilã di atsea multsãmi, cã s-featsirã trei dzãli tsi sta cu mini, sh-nu ari tsi s-mãcã. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Sh-ma s-lji pitrecu la casã ni mãcãt, va-s armãnã pi cali, niscãntsi di elji au vinit di diparti.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Shi ucenitsilji a lui lji-apãndisirã: “Cum va s-li fãntea vãrã cu pãni aeshti aoa tu irnjii?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Sh-elu li-ntribã: “Cãti pãnji avets?” Elji dzãsirã: “Shapti.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Atumtsea elu lã-deadi ordinã ali multsãmi s-apunã mpadi. Sh-lo shaptili pãnji, hãrãstisi, li-frãmsi shi li-deadi a ucenitsilor a-lui tsi s-li pãrtsea ali multsãmi, sh-elji u pãrtsarã. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Avea sh-niscãnti peshtsã njitsi. Dupã tsi li-vluyisi, ordinã tsi shi atselji s-li mpartsã la mutsãmea. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Ashã elji mãcarã shi s-fãntirã, shi adunarã shapti coshuri cu bãcãtsili tsi armasirã. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Atselji tsi mãcarã eara vãrã patru njiljiã di oaminji, dapoea lã-alãsã.<verse eid="MRK 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Prihãbarea di Nvitsãtura a Fariseilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Sh-trãoarã intrã tu varcã cu ucenitsilji a lui shi s-dusi tu locurili a-Dalmanutiljei. <verse eid="MRK 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Vinirã Fariselji shi acãtsarã si sburãscã cu nãsu, cãftãnda un semnu dit tser tsi su bãga tu provã. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Ma elu suschirãnda dzãsi: “Cãtse aeastã gheneratã caftã un semu? Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã aishtei gheneratã nu-va sã si da nitsiunu semn.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Shi-li alãsã, intrã napoi tu varcã shi tricu di napãrti.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Tora ucenitsilji avea agãrshit s-ljea pãni pi nãshi, sh-tu varcã nu-avea tsiva dicãt mashi unã singur pãni. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Isusul lã-urlã dzãcãnda: “S-avets cãshtiga, afirits-vã di maeaua a Fariseilor shi di maeaua al Irodul!” <verse eid="MRK 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Ma atselji discuta namisa di nãshi, dzãcãnda: “Nu avemu pãni.” <verse eid="MRK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Isusul bãgã oarã shi lã-dzãsi: “Cãtse discutats cã nu avets pãni? Ninga nu avets achicãsitã sh-nu avets aduchitã? Ninga u-avets inima nchitritã? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Avets oclji shi nu videts, avets ureclji shi nu-avdzãts? Nu tsinets minti? <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>Cãndu pãrtsãi tsintsili pãnji ti tsintsi njiljã, cãti coshuri mplini cu bãcãtsi adunat?” Elji dzãsirã: “Doisprãdzatsi.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>“Cãndu pãrtsãi shaptili pãnji ti patru njiljã, cãt coshuri mplinã cu pãnji adunatã?” Elji dsãsirã: “Shapti.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Sh-elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Ma cum ninga nu achicãsits?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vindicarea a Orblui dit Betsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Deapoea agiumsi la Betsaida sh-lã adusirã unã orb shi l-pãrãcãlsirã s-bagã mãna. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Atumtsea lu lo di mãnã orbulu, lu scoasi afoarã dit hoarã, shi dupã tsi lji-scuchiã tu oclji shi bãgã mãnjili pi nãsu, lu-ntribã macã videa tsiva. <verse eid="MRK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Shi elu, discljidzãnda ocljilji, dzãsi: “Ma vedu oaminj ca ponji tsi imnã.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Shi Isusul lã bãgã mãnjili napoi pristi ochljilji a lui sh-lu featsi s-veadã cãtrã nsus, shi atsilui lji s-turnã videarea sh-videa ghini itsido. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Sh-Isusul lu-pitricu s-ducã la-casã a lui dzãcãnda: “Nu intrã tu horã sh-nu lji spunã a nitsiunã tu hoarã.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mãrturia a Petrului</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Dapoea Isusul s-dusi deadun cu ucenitsilji a lui pri hoarili a Cesareljei al Filip. Shi pi cali lã-ntribã ucenitsilji a lui dzãcãndã: “Cai dzãc oaminjiljii cã escu mini?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Elji apãndisirã: “Niscãntsã Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu, altsi Ilia, shi-altsilji un dit prufitslji.” <verse eid="MRK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Shi elu lã-dzãsi a lor: “Ma voi, cai dzãtsets cã escu?” Sh-Petrul apãndisinda lji-dsãsi: “Tini eshti Hristolu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Atumtsea elu lã ursi s-nu spunea a nitsiunu ti nãs. <verse eid="MRK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Deapoea Isusul apãrnji s-lã nveatsã a lor cã Hiljilu a-omlui prindi s-pidipseascã di multi lucri, shi va-si s-arniseascã di aushilji, di ma mãrlji a-preftsilor shi di scriblji, cã va si-s vatãmã shi dupã trei dzãli va s-injeadzã. <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Sh-elu lã dzãsi aesti zboari pri fatsã. Sh-Petrul lu lo dinãparti shi apãrnji s-lji vãrgheascã. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Ma elu s-nturnã, vidzu ucenitsilji a lui shi lji aurlã a Petrul dzãcãnda: “Fudz di la mini, drac, cã tini nu ai mintea ti lucrili al Dumnidzãlu, ma ti lucrili a-oamnjilor.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unã Crutsã di Caitsido</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Shi lu acljimã ningã nãsu multsãmea cu ucenitsilji a lui, shi u dzãsi: “Caitsido tsi va s-yinã dupã mini, s-arniseascã bana a lui, shi s-ljea crutsea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">s-ljea crutsea </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Va s-dzãc s-hii etimu s-ti munduieshti shi s-mori tsi s-ti duts dupã Hristolu.</char></note> a lui, shi s-mi urmeadzã. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Cã atselu tsi va s-ascapã bana a lui, va su-cheardã, ma atselu tsi va-su cheardã bana a lui ti itia a mea sh-ti evanghelul, va s-ascapã. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Tsi buneatsã va s-aibã omlu s-amintã ntreagã lumea ma cã ma napoea va s-cheardã suflitlu a lui? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Icã tsi poati s-da omlu tu alãxirea al suflitlu a lui? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Cã a caitsido tsi va-lji yinã rushãni trã mini sh-trã zboarli a meali namisa di aestã gheneratã cãrunã-cãlcatã shi amãrtioasã, trã atsea va lj-yinã rushãni shi a Hiljilu a omlui, cãndu s-agiungã la mãrirea a Tatilui a lui, cu anghilji sãntsã.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Dapoea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Dealihea vã-dzãc cã namisa di voi tsi hits aoa sãntu niscãntsã tsi nu-va u gusteadzã moartea nãinti s-veadã cã va s-yinã cu puteari amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fãnipsirea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Dupã shasi dzãli Isusul lo pri nãsu Petrul, Iacovul shi Ioanul sh-li adusi dinãparti, singur atselji pri un munti analtu. Shi s-alãxi nãintea a lor. <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>Shi stranjili a lui si strãlutsirã shi s-featsirã albi ca neaua, ashã cum nu poati s-li alãgheasca nitsiun alghitor pri loc. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Shi a lor lã si fãnipsi Ilia cu Moise tsi ma zbura cu Isusul. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Atumtsea lu lo sborlu Petrul sh-lji dzãsi al Isus: “Nvitsãtore, trã noi easti ghini s-him aoa, s-adãrãm trei cãlivi, unã trã tini, unã trã Moise shi unã trã Ilia!” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Shi elu nu-shtiea tsi dzãtsea, cã elji eara aspãrats.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Dapoea vini unã nior tsi lã amvãli cu aumbra a lui, sh-dit nior inshi unã boatsã tsi dzãsi: “Aestu easti Hiljilu a meu vrut! Ascultats-lu!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Shi trãoarã elji vidzurã avãrliga, ma nu vidzurã vãrã, dicãt singur Isus cu nãshi. <verse eid="MRK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Tora cãndu ma dipuna dit munti, Isusul lã-ordinã si nu spunã a vãrui lucrili tsi avea vidzut, pãnã-cãndu Hiljilu a-omlui s-injeadzã dit mortsã. <verse eid="MRK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Elji lu tsãnurã sborlu shi s-ntriba un cu alantã cã tsi va s-dzãtsea s-injeadzã dit mortsã. <verse eid="MRK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Dapoea lu ntribarã dzãcãnda: “Cãtse scriblji dzãc cã ma nãinti prindi s-yinã Ilia?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Sh-elu, apãndisinda, lã dzãsi a lor: “Ilia dealihea prindi s-yinã ma nãinti shi s-adarã itsido. Ma ashã cum easti scriatã trã Hiljilu a-omlui, elu prindi s-hibã pidipsit shi s-dispretsuit. <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Ma mini ma vã-dzãc cã Ilia vini sh-cu nãs featsirã tsi vrurã, ashã cum easti scriatã ti nãsu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ficiorlu Epileptic</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Cãndu s-turnã la ucenitsilji a lui, vidzu unã multsãmi marã avãrliga di nãshi sh-niscãnts scribi tsi ma si-ncãcea cu nãshi. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Shi dinãoarã tuta multsãmea, cãndu lu vidzu, s-ciudisi shi vini trãoarã la nãsu ti salutari. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Sh-elu lã ntribã scribilji: “Trã tse ma vã ncãceats cu nãshi?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Shi un dit multsãmea apãndisinda, dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, ts-adush ficiorlu a meu tsi ari un duh mut, <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>shi u-acatsi iutsido, lu-plãscãneashti shi elu spumeadzã, cãrtsãneashti dintsilji shi lji ngljeatsã cicioarili. Shi u dzãsh a ucenitsilor a tãlji su-aĝuneascã, ma elji nu puturã s-lu facã.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Shi elu apãndisinda, dzãsi: “Gheneratã tsi nu-pistipseshti, pãnã-cãndu va s-hiu cu voi? Pãnã-cãndu va s-vã aravdã? Adutsets-lu aoa!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Sh-elji lu-adusirã. Macãt duhlu lu vidzu, lu-plãscãni cu fuchiã cilimeanlu tsi avea cãdzut mpadi, shi s-arucutea spumãnda. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Sh-Isusul lu-ntribã tat-su a lui: “Cãt chiro ari tsi s-fatsi aestã?” Sh-elu dzãsi: “Di cu njic. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Di multi ori lu ari arucatã tu foc sh-tu apã tra s-lu cheardã, ma s-pots s-fats tsiva, s-ai njilã trã noi shi nã agiutã!” <verse eid="MRK 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Sh-Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Macã tini pots s-pistipseshtã, itsido easti puptut trã atselu tsi pistipseashti.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Dinãoarã tatlu a-ficiorlui, aurlãnda cu lãcri, dzãsi: “Mini pistipsescu, Doamne, agiutã ni-pistipsirea a mea!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Atumtsea Isusul, vidzãndã cã multsãmea ma yinea trãoarã, lã aurlã a duhlui nicurat, dzãcãnda: “Tini duh tsi l-fats mut shi surdã, mini ti ursescu, eshi di la nãsu shi nu intrã pute la nãsu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Sh-demonul, aurlãnda shi trunduinda, inshi di la nãsu. Sh-ficiorlu armasi ca mort, ashã cãt mults oaminj dzãtsea: “Ari murit.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Ma Isusul lu-acãtsã di mãnã, lu-sculã shi elu shãdzu pi cicioari. <verse eid="MRK 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Cãndu Isusul intrã tu casã, ucenitsilji a lui lu ntribarã dinãparti: “Cãtse noi nu putum s-lu aĝunim?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Shi elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Aestã soi di duhuri nu-pots si li aĝuneshti altã soiã, dicãt cu pãrãcãlsiri.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isus Spuni Pridarea a Lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Dupã tsi s-nchisirã di aclo, tricurã pri Galilei, sh-elu nu vrea s-lu shtibã vãrã. <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>Elu lã-nvitsa ucenitsilji a lui shi lã dzãtsea a lor: “Trãoarã Hiljilu a-omlui va si s-prida tu mãnjili a oamnjilor shi elji va lu vatãmã, sh-dupã tsi va s-hibã vãtãmatã, elu va s-injeadzã a-treia dzuã.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Ma elji nu li-achicãsea atseali zboari shi avea fricã s-lu ntriba Isusul.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ma Marlu tu Amirãriljea al Dumnidzãul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Shi agiumsirã tu Capernaum, shi cãndu intrã n-casã, lã-ntribã: “Trã tsi vã ntribats namisa di voi pri cali?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Ma elji pãpsirã, cã pri cali dzãtsea cu un-alantã cã cai di elji easti ma marlu. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Atumtsea elu shidzu, lã acljimã di doisprãdzatsilji sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Macã vãrã va s-hibã protlu, prindi s-hibã ma nãpoi di tuts shi huzmichearlu a tutlor.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Shi-lo un cilimeanã sh-lu bãgã namisa a lor. Dapoea lu-lo mbratsã sh-lã dzãsi a lor: <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>“Caitsido tsi aproachi un dit aeshtã cilimenji tu numa a mea, mi aproachi mini, shi caitsido tsi mi aproachi mini, nu mi aproachi mini, ma atselu tsi mi ari pitricut.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Cai Easti cu Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Atumtsea Ioanul lo sborlu sh-dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, noi vidzum un om tsi nu nã-urmeadzã, tsi li aĝunea demonjli tu numa a ta, sh-noi lu chidicãm cã elu nu yinea dupã noi.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Ma Isusul dzãsi: “Nu lu chidicatsã cã nu ari om tsi poati s-facã thavmã tu numea a mea, sh-ma napoiã s-greascã arãu trã mini. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Cã cai nu easti contra a noi, easti cu noi. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Caitsido tsi va vã da unã cupã cu apã tu numa a mea, cã hits a Hristolu, dealihea va vã-dzãcã cu sigurantsã cã nu va s-chearã plãtirea a lui.<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Scãndãljili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>Shi cai va si scandalizeadzã un di aeshti njitsilji tsi pistipseascã la mini, va eara ma ghini ti nãsu s-lji spindzira tu zvercã unã cheatrã marã di moarã sh-si s-arucã tu amari. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Tora, macã mãna a ta ti scandalizeadzi ti amãrtii, taljiu, easti ma ghini trã tini s-intsãr tu bana eternã cu mãna tsungã, dicãt s-ai dau manji shi s-ti duts tu Gehena, tu foclu tsi nu s-astindzi pute. <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>[Aclo iu iermul a lor nu moari sh-foclu nu s-astindzi.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44,46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aesti douã stihuri nu s-aflã tu alti manuscrisi.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Macã ciciorlu a tãu ti scandalizeadzi ti amãrtii, taljiu, easti ma ghini trã tini s-intsrã tu banã shcljiop, dicãt s-ai doau cicioari shi s-ti arucã tu Gehena, tu foclu tsi nu s-astindzi pute. <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>[Aclo iu iermul a lor nu moari sh-foclu nu s-astindzi pute.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Sh-macã ocljiul a tãu ti adutsi tu amãrtii, scoat-lu. Easti ma ghini trã tini s-intsrã tu banã cu un ocljiu, dicãt s-ai doi oclji shi s-ti arucã tu Gehena, <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>aclo iu iermul a lor nu moari sh-foclu nu s-astindzi pute. <verse eid="MRK 9:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>Cã caitsido prindi s-sãreadzã tu foc shi itsi curban prindi s-sãreadzã cu sari. <verse eid="MRK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>Sarea easti bunã, macã sarea cheari njurizma, cu tsi va lu turnats njiurizma? S-avets sari pri voi shi bãnats tu pace namisa di voi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Dispãrtsãrea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Dupã tsi fudzi di aclo, Isusul s-dusi tu locurili a Iudeiljei ningã Iordan, sh-nãpoi s-adunarã avãrliga di nãsu multsãmea. Elu nãpoi ahurhi s-lã nveatsã ashã cum lu avea adetea. <verse eid="MRK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Shi Fariseilji lu bãgarã tu provã shi lu ntribarã: “Macã ari izini bãrbatlu s-lu alasã muljearea?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Shi elu, apãndisinda, lã dzãsi a lor: “Tsi vã ari ordinatã Moise?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Elji dzãsirã: “Moise ari datã volji si-scrii cartea a dispãrtsãriljei shi su-alasã muljearea.” <verse eid="MRK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Sh-Isusul apãndisinda lã-dzãsi a lor: “Ti itia a nchitrisiriljei ali inimi a voastrã elu u scriã atsea regulã. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Ma tu apãrnjita a adãrarãljei, <char style="it">Dumnidzãlu lã adãrã mascrul shi theamina.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/><char style="it">Trã aestã omlu va alasã tatlu shi muma sh-va sta deadun cu muljearea a lui.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/><char style="it">Ashã doljilji va s-hibã un singur trup.</char> Ashã nu ma sãntu doi, ma un singur trup. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Trã atsea omlu s-nu partsã atsea tsi Dumnidzãulu lu ari unificat!” <verse eid="MRK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Sh-la casã ucenitsilji a lui lu-ntribarã nãpoi trã aestã cauzã. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Atumtsea elu lã-dzãsi a lor: “Atselu tsi alasi muljearea a lui shi si nsoari cu un altã, ncalcã cãruna cu nãsã. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Tutashã macã muljearea alasã bãrbatlu shi s-mãriti cu un altu, ncalcã cãruna.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isus shi Cilimenjilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Atumtsea lji-adusirã niscãntsã cilimenji njitsi tsi elu s-bãga mãna pi nãshi. Ma ucenitsilji lã-vãrghirã atselji tsi lji adusirã. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Cãndu Isusul lu vidzu aestã, si nvirinã shi lã dzãsi: “Alasats-lji nitslji cilimenji s-yinã la mini sh-nu li chidãcatsã, cã a lor easti amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã caitsido tsi nu u-aproachi amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu ca un cilimean njicã, nu va s-intrã la nãsã.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Shi cum li lo mbratsã, li ghinicuvãntã bãgãnda mãnjili pi nãshi.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tinerul Avut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Tora cãndu ma s-fãtsea etimu ti cali, inshi dininti trãoarã un om, shi s-dzinucljiã dininti a lui, shi lu-ntribã: “Nvitsãtore bun, tsi prindi s-facã tsi s-mushtinitescu bana di totãna?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Sh-Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Cãtse nji-dzãts bun? Vãru nu easti bun, dicãt mashi un singur, Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Tini li cunoshti ordinli: <char style="it">‘Nu ncalcã cãruna. Nu vatãmã. Nu fur. Nu fã mãrtirii arãdioasã. Nu arãd. Tinjisea tatãlu a tãu shi muma a ta.’</char>” <verse eid="MRK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Sh-elu apãndisinda, lji-dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, tuti atseali mini li-am faptã di cu njicã.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Sh-Isusul lu vidzu cu vreari sh-lji dzãsi: “Un lucru tsã-lipseashti: vindã tuti tsi ai shi dã-li a niavutsilor shi va s-ai un yishteari tu tser. Dapoea haidi, ljea crutsea sh-mi urmeadzã.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Sh-elu s-nvirinã trã aesti sboari shi fudzi mãrinatã cã avea multi averi.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Shi Isusul dupã tsi arucã mutrita avãrliga, lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui: “Cãt greu easti trã atselji tsi au aveari s-intrã tu amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu!” <verse eid="MRK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Ucenitsilji mult s-ciudisirã di aesti sboari a lui. Iarã Isusul gri nãpoi sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Hilji, cãt greu easti tsi s-intrã tu amirãriljea al Dumnizdãu [atselji tsi s-andoapirã la avearea]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aestu stih nu s-aflã tu alti manuscrisi.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Easti ma lishor tsi unã cãmilã s-treacã pri guva a-aclui dicãt s-intrã un avut tu amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Shi elji s-ciudisirã sh-ma multu shi dzãtsea cu un alantã: “Atumtsea cai poati si-ascapã?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Ma Isusul lã vidzu sh-dzãsi: “Aestã trã oaminjli easti nipututã, ma nu ti Dumnidzãul. Cã itsido easti pututã ti Dumnidzãul.” <verse eid="MRK 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Atumtsea Petru lo sborlu sh-dzãsi: “Noi alãsãm itsido shi ti urmãm tini.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Isus apãndisinda, dzãsi: “Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã nu ari vãrã om tsi s-ari alãsat casa, fratsilji, surãrili, tatlu, muma, hiljilji icã agrili trã mini sh-trã evanghelul, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>shi si nu-ljea tora, tu aestã chiro unã sutã di ori ma mult cãsi, frats, surãri, mumi, hilji shi agri, deadun cu avinãrili shi tu eta alantã, bana eternã. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Shi multsã di protsilji va s-hibã atselji di ma napoi, shi atselji di ma nãpoi va s-hibã protsilji.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hiljilji al Zevedeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Atselji eara pri cali cãtrã Ierusalim, shi Isus imna dininti. Shi atselji eara trumuxits sh-lu urma cu fricã. Sh-elu lã adunã di doisprãdzatsilji nãpoi dinãparti shi ahurhi s lã dzãcã tsi va s-lji facã: <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>“Noi ma nidzem cãtrã Ierusalim shi Hiljilu a omlui va sã s-prida a arhipreftsilor shi a scribilor, shi elji va lu giudica cu moarti shi va lu prida tu mãna a pãgãnjilor, <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>shi va lu pizueascã, va lu scuchã, va lu zãpãleascã shi va lu vatãmã, ma elu a treia dzuã va s-injeadzã.” <verse eid="MRK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Atumtsea Iacovul shi Ioanul, hiljilji al Zevedeu s-apruchearã la Isus sh-lji dzãsirã: “Nvitsãtore, noi vrem tsi tini s-fats trã noi atsea tsi va-s-tsã-cãftãmu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Shi elu lã-dzãsi a lor: “Tsi vrets s-fac trã voi?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Elji lji-dsãsirã: “Alas-nã tsi s-nã apunãm unlu dit nandreapta a ta shi alantu dit nastãnga a ta tu mãrirea a ta.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Sh-Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Voi nu-shtits tsi cãftats! Putets voi s-bets cupa a munduirilor tsi mini va s-beu shi s-vã pãtidzats cu atselu pãtigiuni tsi mini escu pãtidzat?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Elji dzãsirã: “Ie, putem.” Sh-Isus lã dzãsi a lor: “Dealihea va s-bets atsea cupã tsi va su beu mini, shi va-s-vi pãtidzats cu atsea pãtigiuni tsi mini escu pãtidzat, <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>ma nu easti ndriptatea a mea tsi s-apunã vãrã dit nandreapta a mea icã dit nastãnga a mea, ma easti trã atselji tsi easti adratã.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Sh-cãndu li avdzãra aesti, alantsã dratsi ahurhirã s-nãrãeascã contra al Iacovul shi al Ioanul. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Ma Isus lã acljimã ningã nãsu sh-lã dzãsi: “Voi lu shtits cã atselji tsi s-acljeamã domnitor a lumãljei lã chivernisescu atselji, shi mãrlji a lor foloseascã pristi nãshi puterea a lor, <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>ma atsea nu prindi s-undzeascã namisa di voi. Macã vãrã di voi tsi va s-facã mar, va s-hibã huzmichearlu a vostru. <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>Shi caitsido di voi tsi va s-hibã protlu, va s-hibã huzmichearlu a tutlor. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Cã shi Hiljilu a omlui nu-vini s-lji huzmitiseascã, ma s-huzmitiseascã shi di dari bana a lui ca prets ti acumprarea a multsilor.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Orbul al Ierico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Shi agiumsirã tu Ierico. Cãndu elu ma insha dit Ierico cu ucenitsilji a lui shi cu unã multsãmi marã, hiljilu al Timaeu, Bartimeul orbu, eara apunat mardzina di cali sh-cãfta. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Cãndu elu avdzã cã atselu tsi ma tritsea eara Isus Nazareas, apãrnji s-aurlã shi s-dzãcã: “Isus, Hiljilu al David, njiliua-mi!” <verse eid="MRK 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Multsã lji-aurla s-pãpsea, ma elu aurla sh-ma multã: “Hiljlu al David, njiliua-mi!” <verse eid="MRK 10:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Shi Isus chindrui shi ordinã tsi s-lu acljeamã. Elji lu acljimarã orblu, dzãcãnda: “Curaiu, scualã-ti, elu ma ti acljeamã!” <verse eid="MRK 10:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Atumtsea elu lu-arucã nclo mantolu a lui, si-sculã sh-vini la Isus. <verse eid="MRK 10:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Shi Isus lo sborlu shi lji-dzãsi: “Tsi vrei s-tsã fac mini!” Orblu lji-dzãsi: “Rabbonul, tsi si-nji-toarnã videarea!” <verse eid="MRK 10:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Shi Isus lji-dzãsi: “Imnã, pistipsirea a ta ti vindicã!” Shi trãoara atsilui lji si-turnã videarea shi s-nchisi pri cali dupã Isus.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Intrarea al Isus tu Ierusalim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Tora cãndu s-apruchiarã di Ierusalim, cãtrã Betfagã shi Betania, ningã Muntili a Masnjilor, Isus pitricu doi di ucenitsilji a lui, <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>dzãcãnda: “Imnats tu hoara di dininti a-voastrã, shi ma cãt s-intrats aclo, va s-aflats un gumãric ligat, tsi nu ljã-avea ncãlicat vãr. Dizligats-lu shi adutsets-lu la mini. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Shi macã vãr vã-dzãtsi: ‘Cãtse ma fãtsets ashã?’, apãndisits-lã: ‘Ljã-lipseashti a Domnului. Elu va u-toarnã trãoarã aoa.’” <verse eid="MRK 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Elji s-dusirã shi aflarã gumãriclu ligat aproapi di unã ushã, pi cali shi u-dizligarã. <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Shi niscãnts di atselji tsi eara aclo lã dzãsirã a lor: “Tsi fãtsets? Cãtse u-dizligats gumãriclu?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Aeshtã l-apãndisirã ashã cum lã avea dzãsã Isus shi elji lã alãsarã s-fugã. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Atumtsea ljã-adusirã al Isus cãricilu, bãgarã pi nãs mantolul a lor shi elu s-apunã pi nãs. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Mults oaminj l-ashtirna stranjili a lor pri cali shi alantsilji tãlja alumãchi di ponj sh-li aruca pri cali. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Shi cum atselji tsi nãdzea nãinti, shi atselji tsi yinjea dupã Isus, aurrla sh-dzãtsea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“<char style="it">Hosana!</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosana-vrea s-dzãc, Alãvdari a Dumnidzãului.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">
    <char style="it">Vluyisitã easti atselu tsi yini tu numa a Domnului!</char><verse eid="MRK 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>
    <char style="it">Vluyistã easti amirãriljea al David, tatãl a nostru tsi yini tu numa a Domnului.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">
    <char style="it">Hosana tu locurili mult analti!</char>”<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Ashã intrã Isus tu Ierusalim shi tu templu. Sh-dupã tsi vidzu ghini itsido, bãgã oarã cã eara amãnat, inshi deadun cu doispridzatsilji cãtrã Betania.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiclu Uscat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Alantã dzuã, cãnd ishirã dit Betania el avea foami. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Shi vidzãnda di diparti un hic tsi avea frãndzi, el s-dusi di videari nacã putea s-afla tsiva aclo. Ma cãnd s-apruchiã nu aflã tsiva, dicãt frãndzi, cã nu eara chirolu a hitsilor. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Shi Isus ljã-gri a hiclui, dzãcãnda: “Nitsunã s-nu mãcã pute frut di la tini.” Sh-ucenitsilji a lui lu-avdzãrã.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Cãtãrsirea al Tempului</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Ashã agiumsirã tu Ierusalim. Isus dupã tsi intrã tu templu, apãrnji s-li aĝuneascã atselji tsi vindea shi acumpãra nãuntru a tempului sh-li rãsturnã measili a alãxitorilor di pãradzi shi scamnili a vinditorilor di purunghi. <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>Sh-nu alãsa vãr tsi s-purta lucruri prit templu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Sh-lã nvitsa, dzãcãnda: “Vahi nu easti scriatã: <char style="it">‘Casa a mea va s-acljeamã casa a pãrãcãlsirljei di tuti natsiunili’</char>? Voi, lu avets adãratã ca unã pishtireauã di furlji!” <verse eid="MRK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Amu scriblji shi mãrlji a preftsilor cãndu li avdzãrã aesti sboari cãfta cã cum s-lu vãtãma, ma avea fricã di nãs, cã tutã multsãmea eara ciudisit di nvitsãtura a lui. <verse eid="MRK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Cãnd s-featsi searã, Isus ishi nafoarã di cãsãbã.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pistipsirea Alihinoasã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Tu alantã dzuã dimineatsa, tricãnda vidzurã cã hiclu eara uscatã dit radãtsinã. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Shi Petrul adusi a-minti shi lj-dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, ia, hiclu tsi tini blãstimash easti uscatã.” <verse eid="MRK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Sh-Isus apãndisinda u dzãsi a lor: “Avets pistipsirea al Dumnidzãu! <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Dealihea vã-dzacã macã vãr va ljã dzãc aishtui munti: ‘Scolã-ti shi arucã-ti tu amari’, sh-nu va s-aibã dilemã tu inima a lui, ma va s-pistipseascã cã atsea tsi ma dzãtsi va s-facã, itsido va s-lji si-adarã. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Trã atsea ma vã dzãc, tuti atseali tsi voi cãftatsã pãrãcãlsinda, pistipsits cã va lã-loats shi a vauã va-sã si da. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Shi cãndu ahurhits s-pãrãcãlsits, macã avets tsiva contra a vãrnui, ljirtats-lu tsi shi Tatãlu a vostru tsi easti tu tseruri, s-vã ljeãrtã amãrtiili a voastri. <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>[Macã voi nu ljirtats, nits Tatãlu a vostru tsi easti tu tseruri, nu va-s-vã ljeartã amãrtiili a voastri.]”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atselu stih nu s-aflã tu alti veaclji manuscrituri.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntrãbarea al Fariseilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Dapoea elji vinjirã nãpoi tu Ierusalim, shi cãndu el imna prit templu, mãrlji a preftsilor, scriblji, shi aushlji s-apruchiarã, <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>Sh-lji dzãsirã: “Cu tsi puteari li fats tini aesti lucri? Cai ts-u deadi aestã puteari tsi s-li fats aesti lucri?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Sh-Isus apãndisinda u dzãsi a lor: “Sh-mini va vã ntrebã tsiva. Apãndisits-nji sh-mini va vã-dzãc cã cu tsi puteari li fac aesti lucri. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Pãtidzarea a Ioanului eara dit tser ama di la oaminji? Apãndisits-nji.” <verse eid="MRK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Elji ahurhirã s-minduea namisa di nãsh: “Ma s-dzãtsem ‘dit tser’, elu va s-dzãc: ‘Atumtsea cãtse voi nu lji-pistipsitã?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Ma s-ljã dzãtsem ‘di la oamnjili…’” (elji aveau fricã di populu, cã tuts dzãtsea cã Ioanlu easti dealihea un prufit). <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Trã atsea apãndisinda, lji dzãsirã al Isus: “Nu lu-shtim.” Sh-Isus apãndisinda, u dzãsi a lor: “Sh-nits mini nu ma vã-dzãc cã cu tsi puteari li fac aesti lucri.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayinjitorlji Arãlji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Sh-deapoea apãrnji s-lã greascã cu parabolã: “Un om siminã un ayinjã, u avãrligã cu gard, adãrã unã loc di zdruminari aua, adãrã un pirĝu trã vigljari sh-lu alãsã a niscãnts ayinjitorilor shi deapoea s-dusi diparti. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Shi tu chirolu a cutseariljei pitricu un sclav la ayinjitorlji di loari di nãsh un parti di auã a-ayinjiljei. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Ma elji lu-acãtsarã, lu bãturã sh-lu turnarã cu manjili goali. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>El pitricu nãpoi un altã sclav, ma elji dupã tsi lu-agudirã cu chetri, lu pliguirã tu cap sh-u turnarã rushinat. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Nãpoi pitricu ninga un altã, ma elji lu vãtãmarã. Ma nãpoi pitricu mults altsã shi di aeshti mults li-bãturã, shi alantsilji lã-vãtãmrã. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Lj-arãmasi ninga un di pitritseari: hiljilu a lui vrut. Tu soni l-pitricu atselu dzãcãnda: ‘Ti hiljilu a meu va s-aibã respect.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Ma ayinjitorilji dzãsirã unu cu alantu: ‘Aestu easti clirunomlu, hai s-lu vãtãmãm shi s-nã armãnã a nauã clirunumia.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Sh-lu acãtsarã, lu-vãtãmarã, shi lu-arucarã nafoarã di ayinji. <verse eid="MRK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>Tsi va s-facã domnul a-ayinjiljei? Elu va s-yinã shi va s-li cheardã ayinjitorlji shi ayinjea va s-lu-da a alantsilor. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Ma nu lu-avets ghivãsitã aestã scritura: ‘Cheatra tsi muritorlji lu-arucarã, s-featsi cheatra a cohilui?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Easti unã cheatrã di sus tsi u tsãni ngãrcarea a casãljei.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Atsea easti faptã di la Domnul shi easti unã thavmã tu ocljilji a noastri.’” <verse eid="MRK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Shi elji cãftarã s-lu acatsã, cã achicãsirã cã elu lã avea dzãsã atsea parabolã contra a lor, ma avea fricã di multsãmea, sh-lu-alãsarã shi fudzirã.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Plãtirea a Taxilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Dupã atsea lji-pitricurã niscãntsã Farisei shi Irodianji tsi s-lu acatsã tu zboari. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Aeshti vinirã sh-lji dzãsirã: “Nvitsãtore, noi lu shtim cã tini eshtã dealihea shi nu ntreghi di vãrã, cã nu badzã oarã fãnipsirea a-oamnjilor, ma lji nvetsã calea a Dumnidzãului dupã ndriptatea. Easti ndrept s-plãtesht taxa a Cezarului ama nu? Prindi s-lu plãtim ama nu?” <verse eid="MRK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Ma elu, cunuscãnda ipucrizia-a lor, lã-dzãsi: “Cãtse mi bãgats tu provã? Adutsets-nji un denar tsi s-lu ved!” <verse eid="MRK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Elji lji-adusirã. Shi elu lã dzãsi a lor: “A cui easti aestã fatsã shi aestu priscris?” Elji lji-dzãsirã: “A Cesarului.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Atumtsea Isus apãndisi sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Dats-ljã a Cesarului atsea tsi easti a Cesarului, shi a Dumnidzãului atsea tsi easti a Dumnidzãlui.” Shi elji s-ciudisirã cu nãsu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sadutselji shi Injearea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Dapoea vinirã niscãntsi Sadutsei cai dzãc tsi nu ari injeari, sh-lu ntribarã dzãcãnda: <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>“Nvitsãtore, Moisul nã-alãsã scrisã tsi cãndu moari fratili a vãrui shi lu-alasi muljearea ni-fãrã cilimenji, fratili a lui prindi si-nsoarã cu veduva tra s-lji facã dupãyinitori a fratilui. <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Tora eara shapti frats, protlu si-nsurã sh-muri ni alãsatã cilimenji. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Lu lo a doilu, ma sh-elu muri ni-alãsat cilimenji, tutashã shi a treilu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Di shaptilji lu loarã di muljearã sh-murirã, shi nu alãsarã clirunonji (dupãyinitori). Shi dupã tuts muri sh-muljearea. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>La injearea, cãndu va-s injeadzã, muljearea a cui di nãshi va s-hibã ea? Cã di shaptilji u-avurã muljeari.” <verse eid="MRK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Isus apãndisinda lã dsãsi a lor: “Trã atsea voi hits tu cãbati cã nu li-shtits nitsi scriturili nitsi putearea a Dumnidzãului. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Cãndu oaminjlji va s-injeadzã dit mortsã, nitsi va si-nsoarã, nitsi va sã-nsoarã, ma va s-hibã ca anghilji dit tser. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Cãt di inyiarea a mortsilor, nu avets ghivãsit tu cartea a Moisul cã cum gri Dumnidzãul dit rudz dzãcãnda: ‘Mini escu Dumnidzãlu al Abraham, Dumnidzãlu al Isac, shi Dumnidzãlu al Iacov.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Elu nu easti Dumnidzãlu a mortsãlor, ma Dumnidzãlu a yiilor. Ashã cã voi fãtsets cãbati.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ursirea Atsea Marã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Shi unlu di scriblji tsi avea avdzãtã zburarea a lor, achicãsãnda cã elu lã avea apãndisitã ghini, s-apruchiã shi lu-ntribã: “Cai easti protlu di tuti ordinãrili?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Shi Isus apãndisi: “Protlu ordin a tutilor easti: ‘Ascultã Israel! Domnul, Dumnidzãulu a nostru easti singurlu Domn.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Shi ‘S-vrei Domnulu, Dumnidzãulu a tãu, cu tutã inima a ta, cu tutã suflitlu a tãu, cu tutã mintea a ta, shi cu tutã putearea a ta!’ Aestã easti protlu ordin. <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Shi a doilu lji-undzeashti aishtui: ‘S-lu vrei aproapi-lu a tãu ca vetea a ta.’ Nu ari altã ordinã ma marã di aesti.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Shi scriblu lji dzãsi: “Ghini, nvitsãtore. Ai dzãsã dupã alihia, cã ari singur un Dumnidzã shi nu ari vãrã altã dicãt elu. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Shi s-lu vrei cu tutã inimã, cu tutã mintea, cu tutã suflitlu shi cu tutã putearea, shi s-lu vrei aproapilui ca vetea a ta, ma multu di cãt olocaustlji shi curbãnjilji.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Isus vidzãnda cã atselu eara apãndisitã cu minti, lji dsãsi: “Tini nu eshti diparti di amirãriljea a Dumnidzãului.” Sh-nitsun altã nu cutidzea s-lu ntriba.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hristolu, Hiljilu al David</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Shi Isus nvitsãnda tu templu, dsãsi: “Cum poatã s-dzãcã scriblji cã Hristolu easti Hiljilu al David? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Cã mashi Davidul, pri Suflitlu Sãmtu dsãsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="it">‘Domnulu lji-dsãsi a Domnului a meu:</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="it">“Shãdz tu nandreaptea a mea,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="it">pãn cãndu s-li facã nemitsilji a tãlji scamnã</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="it">di cicioarili a tali.”’</char><verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>Mashi Davidul lu acljeamã Domn, cum poati s-hibã hiljilu a lui?” Shi multsãmea lu avdza cu harauã.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ipucrizia a Scribljilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Shi elu lã dsãtsea a lor tu nvitsitura a lui: “Afirits-vã di scriblji, tsi lã arãsescu s-imnã cu stranji lundzi shi s-li saluteadzã tu padi, <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>shi s-aibã protili locuri tu sinagogã shi protili locuri uspetsi. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Lã mãcã casili a veduvilor shi tra si s-veadã s-pãrãcãlsescu multu. Elji va s-ljea un giudicari ma greu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oferta a Veduvãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Shi Isus s-apunã nãinti di cutia a aishteariljei shi mutrea oaminjli tsi bãga nãuntru denar, avutslji bãga nãuntru ma multu. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Vini unã veduvã niavutã sh-bãgã doi pãradz njitsi, tsi fac un cuadrant.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Easti pãradz nicu dip, un monetu.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Shi Isus li-acljimã ucenjitsili a lui ningã nãsu shi lã dsãsi: “Vã dzãc dealihina cã aeastã veduvã niavutã ari bãgat tu cutii ma multu di tuts alantsilji. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Cã tuts bãgarã nãuntru dit primultulu a lor, ma ea cu ni-avearea a ljei bãgã tutã tsi avea di bãnari.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Prufitsia di Templu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Cãndu elu ma inshea di templu, un di ucenitsilji a lui lj-dsãsi: “Nvitsãtore, vedz tsi chetri shi tsi adãrãturi!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Shi Isus apãndisinda lj-dsãsi: “Li videts aesti adãrãturi mãri? Nu va s-armãnã cheatrã pisti cheatrã ni dãrãmat.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahurhirea a Dureriljei di Amãntari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Shi dupã tsi elu eara apunat pri Muntili a Masnjilor nãinti a tempului, Petrul, Iacovul, Ioanul shi Andrea lu ntribarã dinãparti: <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>“Dzã-nã, cãndu va s-facã aesti lucri shi cai va s-hibã semnul a chiroului tsi tuti atseali lucri va s-ascapã?” <verse eid="MRK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Isus apãndisinda a lor ahurhi sã-dzãcã: “Bãgats mintea s-nu vã-arãdã vãrã. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Cã va-s yinã multsã pi numa a mea dzãcãnda: ‘Mini escu Hristolu.’ Shi va si s-arãdã multsã oaminj. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Ma cãndu s-avdzãts si zburãscu di alumti shi di hãbãri di alumttã, nu vã cutrimburats, cã aesti lucri prindi si s-adarã, ma nu va s-hibã bitisita. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Va sã scoalã natsiunea contra a natsiunãljei, amirãriljea contra a amirãriljei, va s-facã cutremburi pri multi locuri, va s-hibã jeali di pãni. Atseli lucri va s-hibã ahurihirea a durearilor di amintari. <verse eid="MRK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>Cãshtigats-vã ti bana a voastrã! Cã va vã prida la giudicãtorlji shi va vã batã tu sinagogã. Va vã scoatã nãinti a guvernatorilor shi amiradzilor di itia a mea tsi s-mãrtirsits nãinti a lor. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Ma nãinti prindi tsi s-hibã predicatã evanghelul la tuts oaminjli. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Tora cãndu va v-aducã s-vi prida, s-nu avets gaile di manãinti trã atsea tsi prindi s-dsãtsetsã shi s-nu mintuits. Ma dsãtsets tsi vã yini tu minti tu oara atsea, cã nu hits voi tsi grits ma easti Duhlu Sãmtu. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Tora fratili va prida fratilu a lui la moarti shi tatlãlu hiljilu, shi hiljilji va sã scoalã contra a pãrintsilor shi va lã facã s-moarã. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Shi voi va s-hits aurats di tuts di itia a numãljei a mea, ma atselu tsi va sã aravdã pãnã tu soni, va s-hibã ascãpat.”<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mundirea Atsea Marã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>“Shi cãndu s-lu videts urãtsãmea a-aspãrgãturãljei [tsi easti spusã di prufitul Daniel], tsi sta aclo iu nu prindi s-eara [cai ghivãseashti s-lu aducheascã], atumtsea atselji tsi va s-hibã tu Iuda, a s-fugã pri muntsã. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Shi atselu tsi easti pri citia a casãljei, s-nu dipunã, sh-nitsi s-intrã tu casã di loari tsiva di la casa-a lui. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Shi atselu tsi va s-hibã tu cãmpu, si-nu s-toarnã nãpoi di loari stranjilu a lui. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Tora cavai di muljerili sãrtsinati shi atseali cu njitsi tu sinã, tu atseali dzãli. <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Shi pãrãcãlsits-vã tsi fudzirea a voastrã s-nu hibã iarna. <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Cã tu atsea dzuã va s-hibã una munduiri marã, ma marlu ditu apãrnjita a adãrarãljei a omlui tsi featsi Dumnidzãlu pãnã azã, shi ahtari nu va s-aibã pute. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Shi macã Domnulu nu va li-avea shcurtatã atseli dzãli, nitsiunã om nu va s-ascãpa, ma Domnulu li shcurtã atseali dzãli di itia a aleptsilor tsi elu lã aleapsi. <verse eid="MRK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>Atumtsea macã vãrã va vã-dzãcã: ‘Ia, Hristolu easti aoa’, icã: ‘Easti aclo’, nu lu pistipsitsã. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Cã va s-aspunã hristoshi arãdioshi shi prufits arãdioshi tsi va s-facã semnji shi thavmati tsi s-arãdã, ma s-poatã shi aleptsãlji. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Ma voi bãgats minti! Ia, mini vã spushã ti itsido.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nturnarea a Hiljilui a Omului</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>“Ma tu atseali dzãli, dupã atsea munduiri, soarili va sã scutidiseascã shi luna nu va s-da anghilicirea a ljei, <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>stealili a tserlui va s-cadã shi puterili tu tseruri va s-trundueascã. <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>Atumtsea va lu veadã Hiljilu a omlui yininda pri niori, cu puteari mari shi mãriri. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Atumtsea elu va pitreacã anghilji a lui shi va li-adunã aleptsãlji a lui dit patruli vimturi, dit mardzina a loclui pãnã tu mardzina a tserlui.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola al Hiclu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>“Tora achicãsits nvitsãtura a hiclui: cãndu dedzili a lui s-muljeadzã shi scoatã frãndzi, voi u shtits cã veara easti aproapi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Ashã shi voi, cãndu va videts cã ma s-facã aesti lucri, s-lu shtits cã easti aproapi, ningã ushã. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Dealihea ma vã dzãc: cã aestã gheneratã nu va s-treacã, pãn cãndu tuti aesti va s-hibã adrati. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Tserlu shi loclu va s-treacã, ma zboarili a meali nu va s-treacã.”<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bagats Oarã ti Chirolu di Soni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>“Cãt di atsea dzuã shi di atsea oarã, nitsiun nu lu shti, nitsi anghilji dit tser, nitsi Hiljilu, ma mashi Tatãlu. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Bãgats minti, s-hits dishtiptat shi pãrãcãlsits-vã, cã nu lu shtits cãndu va s-hibã oara. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Easti cabunoarã un om tsi nchisinda ti cali, alasi casa a lui shi da puteari a huzmichearilor a lui, cathiun tu loclu a lui, shi portarlu lu urseashti s-hibã dishtiptat. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>S-hits dishtiptats, cã nu lu shtits cãndu va s-yinã domnulu ali casi, seara ma njeadzãnoapti, cãndu cãnti cucotulu, ma dimineatsa. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Elu turnãnda niashtãptat, s-nu vã aflã tu somn. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Tora, aestã tsi vã dzãcã a voauã, lu dzãcã a tutulor: S-hits dishtiptat!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Apofãsirea a Preftsilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Dupã doauã dzãli eara Pashtili shi Adzãmili, shi ma mãrilji a preftsilor shi scriblji cãfta cum s-lu acãtsa Isus cu ilei, shi s-lu vãtãma. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Ma dzãtsea: “Nu tu chirolu a sãrbãtoarãljei, tsi s-nu aibã mintiturã tu populu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isus la Betania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Tora elu eara tu Betania, tu casa al Simon tsi eara lepros, shi cãndu eara la measã intrã unã muljiearã cu un vasã di alabastru cu untulem njiurizmos cu nard curat, multã scump shi ea lu frãmsi vaslu di alabastru shi lj-lu-vãrsã untulemlu pri cap. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Niscãnts s-nãrãirã shi dzãsirã: “Cãtse tutã aestã hãrgiuiri a untulemlui?” <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Cã aestu untulem putea s-vindea ma mult di trei suti di denari shi aesti si s-da a niavutsilor. Shi eara nevrisits cu nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Ma Isus dzãsi: “Alãsats-lu! Cãtse u munduits? Ea featsi un lucru bunã trã mini. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Cã niavutsilji va li avets totãna cu voi, shi cãndu s-vrets, putets s-lã fãtsets ghini. Ma mini nu va mi-avets totãna. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Ea featsi atsea tsi putu, aumsi di ma nãinti truplu a meu trã ngrupari. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Dealihea ma vã dzãcã cã tu tutã dunjeaua iutsido tsi va s-hibã predicat aestu evanghelu, va sã spunea shi atsea tsi ea featsi, trã adutsearea aminti a ljei.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pretsul di Pridari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Atumtsea Iuda Iscariotul, un di doisprãdzatsilji, s-dusi la mãrilji a preftsilor tsi s-prida Isusul. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Shi elji cãndu lu avdzãrã, s-hãrãsirã shi lji tãxirã cã va lji da pãradzi. Ashã elu cãfta oara tsi prindi tsi s-lu prida.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Etimãsirea a Pashtiljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Tora tu prota dzuã a Adzãmilor, cãndu s-featsi curbanlu a Pashtiljei ucenitsilji a lui dzãsirã: “Iu vrei s-nidzem s-adrãm di mãcari Pashtili?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Shi elu pitricu doi di ucenjitsili a lui dzãcãnda: “Imnats-vã tu cãsãbã shi aclo va s-adunats un om tsi tsãni un stamnã plinã cu apã, urmats-lu atselu. <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>Shi aclo iu elu va s-intrã, dzãtsets-lji a domnului ali casi: ‘Nvitsãtorlu ntreabi: Iu easti udãlu tsi putem s-mãcãm Pashtili cu ucenitsilji a melji?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Shi elu va vã spunã nsus unã udã marã uidisitã shi gata. Aclo adãrats-lu ti noi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Ucenitsilji a lui s-dusirã, agiumsirã tu cãsãbã shi aflarã ashã cum dzãsi elu, shi etimãsirã Pashtili.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsina a Pashtiljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Cãndu s-featsi seara, Isusul vini cu di doisprãdzatsilji. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Cãndu ma shidea la measã shi ma mãca, Isusul dzãsi: “Dealihea vã dzãcã cã un di voi tsi ma mãcã cu mini, va mi vindã.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Atumtsea elji ahurhirã sã nvirineadzã shi dzãtsea un cu alantu: “S-nu hiu mini?” [Shi un altã dzãsi: “S-nu hiu mini?”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tu alti manuscrisi aestã nu s-aflã.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Shi elu, apãndisinda lã dzãsi a lor: “Easti un di doisprãdzatsilji tsi moalji cu mini tu cãtsãn. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Ma Hiljilu a omlui ma s-dutsi cum easti scriatã trã nãsu, ma cavai di atselu om tsi vindi Hiljilu a omlui. Va eara ma ghini trã nãsu, tsi atselu om s-nu eara amintat pute!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pisti-ligãturea Noauã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Shi candu elji ma mãca, Isusul lo pãnea, ghinicuvãntã, u pãrtsã, sh-lu deadi a lor dzãcãnda: “Loats shi mãcats. Aestu easti truplu a meu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Deapoea lo cupa, lu hãrãstãsi, lã deadi a lor shi tuts biurã di nãsã. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Atumtsea lã dzãsi: “Aestu easti sãndzilu a meu, a pistãligarãljei, tsi s-vearsi trã multsã. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Dealihea vã dzãcã cã nu va beau ma dit carpolu a yinjãlei pãnã tu atsea dzuã cãndu va s-lu beau di nou tu amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Shi dupã tsi cãntarã un himn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eara un adet a Iudeilor tsi s-cãnta un psalm tu vahtea a Pashtiljei. Nãinti di mãcari elji cãntau Ps. 113-114 shi Ps. 115-118 dupã vahti di mãcari. </char></note>, inshirã shi s-dusirã cãtrã Muntsili a Masnjilor.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isus shi Petrul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Shi Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Voi tuts va s-vã scandalizats cu mini aestã searã, cã easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="it">‘Va lu agudescã picurarlu</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="it">shi oili va s-arãspãndeascã.’</char><verse eid="MRK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Ma dupã tsi va mi-injedzã, mini va mi ducã nãinti di voi tu Galilei.” <verse eid="MRK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Shi Petrul lji-dzãsi: “Ca s-hibã cã tuts alantsilji s-scandalizeascu cu tini, mini nu va mi scandalizescu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Shi Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Mini ma ts-dzãcã dealihea cã azã, tu aeastã noapti, nãinti tsi cucotlu s-cãntã doauã ori, tini va mi aleapideshti trei ori.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Ma elu insistãnda, dzãtsea: “Shi ca s-hibã tsi prindi s-mor cu tini, nu va ti aleapidescu pute.” Un soi dzãsirã shi tuts alantsilji.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isus tu Ghetsemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Deapoea agiumsirã la un loc tsi s-acljima Ghetsemani, shi elu lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui: “Apunats-vã aoa, pãn cãndu mini s-hiu pãrãcãlsitã.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Shi lo cu nãsu Petrul, Iacovul shi Ioanul, shi ahurhi s-aibã frica shi agoniã. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Sh-lã dãsi a lor: “Suflitlu a meu easti multu nvirinat, pãnã tu moarti, armãnets aoa shi s-hits dishtiptat.” <verse eid="MRK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Shi, cum s-dusi nihiam nãinti, cãdzu pi dintsi shi s-pãrãcãlsea, tsi ma s-putea, s-fudzea di la nãsu aestã oarã. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Shi dzãsi: “Abba, Tati, itsido trã tini easti putut, dipãrteadz-lu di la mini aestã cupã. Ma nu si s-fac atsea tsi voiu mini, ma atsea tsi vrei tini!” <verse eid="MRK 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Shi s-turnã nãpoi, li aflã durnjinda shi lji dzãsi a Petrului: “Simon ma dornji? Nu putush sã stai dishtiptat nits unã oarã? <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Armãnets dishtiptat shi pãrãcãlsit-vã tsi s-nu intrats tu provã. Duhlu easti etimu, ma truplu easti niputut.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>S-dipãrtã nãpoi shi s-pãrãcãlsi dzãcãnda idhiili zboari. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Shi cãndu s-turnã, lã aflã nãpoi tu somn, cã ocljilji a lor eara greli shi elji nu shtia tsi s-apãndisea. <verse eid="MRK 14:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>S-toarnã di a treia oarã shi lã dzãtsi a lor: “Ninga ma durnjits sh-vã discurmats. Nãmalu, vini oara! Ia, Hiljilu a omlui ma s-prida tu mãnjili a amãrtioshilor. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Sculats-vã, s-ni dutsem. Ia, atselu tsi ma mi prida easti aproapi!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Acãtsarea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Shi tu atsea oarã, cãndu elu ninga ma grea, vini Iuda, un di doispridzatsilji, shi cu nãsu unã multsãmi marã cu spãts shi cu pãlenji, pitricut di mãrlji a preftsilor, di scriblji shi di aushlji. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Sh-elu tsi ma lu pridea lji avea datã atsilor un semn: “Cai va s-bashã, elu easti. Acãtsats-lu shi adutsets-lu cu mult cãshtigã.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Shi cum agiumsi s-apruchiã trãoarã la nãsu shi lji dzãsi: “Rabbi, Rabbi!” Shi lu bãshã. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Atumtsea elji bãgarã mãna pi nãs shi u-acãtsarã. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Un di atselji tsi s-alfa aclo, scoasi spata, agudi sclavlu a arhipreftului shi lji tãljiã ureacljea. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Shi Isusul apãndisinda, lã dzãsi: “Avets vinit cu spãts shi cu pãlenji tsi s-mi acãtsats? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Cathi dzuã earam namisa di voi tu templu nvitsãnda shi voi nu mi acãtsat. Ma aeastã s-fatsi s-implineascã Scriturili.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Atumtsea ucenitsilji lu alãsarã sh-fudzirã tuts. <verse eid="MRK 14:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Shi un tinir, tsi era anvãrtit cu un pãndzã pi truplu dispuljat ma lu urma, shi elji lu acãtsarã. <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>Elu u alãsã pãndza shi fudzi dispuljat.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isus Nãinti al Sinedrul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Atumtsea elji lu adusirã Isusul la arhipreftlu iu s-adunarã mãrilji a preftsilor, aushlji shi scriblji. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Shi Petrul lu urmã di diparti pãn nãuntru tu pãlatlu a arhipreftului shi s-apunã aclo deadun cu vigljitorlji shi s-ncãldza ningã foc. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Shi mãrlji a preftsilor shi tutã sinedrul cãfta mãrtirii contra al Isus s-lu vãtãma, ma nu ma afla. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Mults oaminj fãtsea mãrtirii arãdioasã contra a lui, ma mãrtiriili a lor nu undzea. <verse eid="MRK 14:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Atumtsea niscãnts si scularã shi mãrtirsirã cu ilei contra a lui dzãcãnda: <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>“Noi lu avem avdzãtã cã tsi ari dzãsã: ‘Mini va lu aspargã aestu templu adãratã cu mãnjili, shi di trei dzãli va s-adarã unã altã tsi nu easti faptã di oamnjilji.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Ma nits ashã mãrtiria a lor nu s-uidisea. <verse eid="MRK 14:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Atumtsea si sculã arhipreftulu namisa di cunvend shi lu ntribã Isusul dzãcãnda: “Nu apãndiseshti dip? Tsi ma mãrtirsescu aeshtã contra a tsãia?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Ma elu pãpsi shi nu apãndisi dip. Arhipreftul nãpoi lu ntribã shi lj-dzãsi: “Tini eshti Hristolu, Hiljilu a Ghinicuvãntatlui?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Shi Isusul dzãsi: “Mini escu. <char style="it">Shi voi va lu videts Hiljilu a omlui apunat tu nandreapta a Puteariljei shi vininda cu norilji a tserlui.</char>” <verse eid="MRK 14:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Atumtsea arhipreftulu, arupãnda stranjili dzãsi: “Tsi ananghi avem ti mãrtirioshilji? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Voi lu avdzãt blãstemlu, cum lu videts?” Shi tuts lu giudicarã cu moarti. <verse eid="MRK 14:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Shi niscãnts ahurhirã s-lu scuchea, s-lu anvãlea fatsa, shi s-lu agudea cu shupleacã shi s-lji dzãtsea: “Prufitipsea!” Shi vigljãtorlji lu agudea.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petrul Arniseashti Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Cãndu Petrul eara nghios tu pãlat, vini unã sclavã a arhipreftului. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Shi cãndu vidzu Petrul tsi ma s-ncãldza, bãgã oarã shi lj-dzãsi: “Shi tini earai cu Isus Nazareas.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Petru lu arnisi dzãcãnda: “Nu lu cunosc, nu achicãsescu tsi dzãts.” Deapoea ishi nafoarã tu ubor shi cucotlu cãntã. <verse eid="MRK 14:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Shi sclava vidzãnda nãpoi ahurhi s-lu greascã atsilor tsi eara aclo: “Aestu easti unlu di nãshi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Ma elu nãpoi lu arnisi. Shi nihiamã ma nãpoi oaminjli lji dzãsirã nãpoia a lui Petru: “Dealihina tini eshti un di atselji, cã tini eshti Galilean.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Ma elu ahurhi s-blastimã shi si spigiurã: “Mini nu lu cunoscu atselu om ti cai ma grits.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Shi cucotlu cãntã di a doaua oarã. Atumtsea a Petrului lj-vini tu minti zborlu tsi Isusul lji avea dzãsã: “Ma nãinti tsi cucotlu s-cãntã di doauã oarã, tini va mi arniseshti trei ori.” Shi cum mindui aestu, plãmsi.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Nãinti al Pilat, Guvernatorlu Romac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Cãrund dimineatsa mãrilji a preftsilor cu aushlji, scriblji shi tut Sinedrul fãtsea consiliu, u ligarã Isusul, lu adusirã nafoarã shi lji-lu-deadirã al Pilat. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Shi Pilat lu ntribã: “Tini eshti amirãlu a Iudenjilor?” Shi elu apãndisinda lji dzãsi: “Tini dzãts!” <verse eid="MRK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Shi mãrilji a preftsilor lu acuza di multi lucri, ma elu nu apãndisea dip. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Pilatul lu ntribã nãpoi dzãcãnda: “Nu apãndiseshti dip? Vedz ti cãti lucri ti acuzeascã!” <verse eid="MRK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Ma Isusul nu apãndisi dip, ahãtãt cãt Pilatlu arãmasi ciudisitã. <verse eid="MRK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Tu cathi sãrbãtoari eara ca adet tsi su-alãsa atsilor un hãpsãnit, caitsido tsi populu cãfta. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Shi eara tu hapsi un om acljimatã Baraba, deadun cu sotsilji a lui rebilj, tsi avea faptã un vãtãmãri la un ribiljusiri. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Shi multsãmea, aurlãnda, ahurhi tsi s-caftã s-facã ashã cum avea faptã totãna cu nãsh. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Iar Pilatul lã apãndisi a lor dzãcanda: “Vrets s-vã sãlghescu amirãlu a Iudenjilor?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Cã lu shtiea tsi mãrilji a preftsilor lu avea pridatã di inati. <verse eid="MRK 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Ma mãrilji a preftsilor pimsãr multsãmea s-cãfta tsi s-lã sãlghea Baraba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Shi Pilatul u lo zborlu nãpoi shi lã dzãsi a lor: “Tsi vrets s-fac cu atselu tsi voi lu acljimats amirãlu a Iudenjilor?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Elji aurlarã nãpoi: “Crutsisits-lu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Shi Pilatul lã dzãsi a lor: “Ma tsi arãu ari faptã?” Atumtsea elji aurlarã shi ma multã: “Crutsisits-lu?” <verse eid="MRK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Tr-atsea Pilatul vrãnda s-lji arãsea a multsãmiljei, lu deadi Baraba. Shi dupã tsi lu zãpãlirã Isusul, lu deadir a lor tsi s-lu crutsisea.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pizuirea Nãinti di Crutsisiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Shi suldatsilji lu-dusirã Isusul tu uborlu di nãntru tu pãlat, shi adunarã tutã cohorta. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Lu-nviscurã cu sirmã, shi mplãtirã unã cãruni di schinj shi lj-u bãgarã pri capã <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Dapoea ahurhirã s-lu saluteascã, dzãcãnda: “Sãnãtati amirãlu a Iudenjilor!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Shi lu agudea pri capã cu un cãlam, u scuchea shi dzinucljãnda diniti a lui, lu alãvda. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Dupã tsi arãsirã cu nãs, lu disviscurã purpura, lu nviscurã cu stranjili a lui, shi lu scoasirã afoarã s-u crutsisea.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Crutsisirea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Elji ursirã un cãlãtor, Simonul di Cyrenea tsi s-turna dit agru, tatilu a Alexandrului shi a Rufiljei, tsi s-lu tsãnea crutsea a lui. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Dapoea lu adusirã Isusul tu loclu acljimatã Golgota, tsi va s-dzãcã “Loclu a Cafcãljei.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Lji deadirã s-bea yinã misticat cu mirã, ma elu nu u lo. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Shi dupã tsi lu crutsisirã, li pãrtsãrã stranjili a lui shi arucarã soarti tsi s-shtiea tsi va avea cathiunã. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Eara oara a treia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ora a treia va s-dzãc ora noauã dimineatsa</char></note> cãndu lu crutsisirã. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Shi scritura tsi spunea itia a cãtiĝurisiriljei tsi eare bãgatã pri nãsu dzãtsea: “Amirãlu a Iudeilor.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Deadun cu nãs crutsisrã doi furi, unlu tu nadreptea a lui shi alantu tu nastãnga a lui. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>[Shi ashã s-mplinã Scritura tsi dzãtsi: “Elu s-luguri cu urutsilji.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dit Isaia 53:12</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Shi elji tsi tritsea atsia aproapi lu ngiura shi giucãnda caplu, dzitsea: “Tini tsi aspãrdzeai templu shi lu adãrai di trei dzãli, <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>ascapã vetea a ta shi dipunã di crutsi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Tutashã shi mãrilji a preftsilor shi scriblji arãdãnda dzãtsea cu un alantu: “Alantsilji lã ascãpã, ma vetea a lui nu putu s-lu ascapã. <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Hristolu, amirãlu a Israelui, s-dipunã di crutsã tsi s-lu videm shi s-lu pistipsim.” Shi atselji tsi eara crutsisit deadun cu nãsu, lu ngiura.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Moartea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Dapoea cãndu vini a shasea oarã, ntuneariclu amvãli tut loclu pãn la a noaua oarã. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Shi tu a noaua oarã Isusul aurlã cu boatsã analtã: “<char style="it">Eloi, Eloi lama sabacthani?</char>”, tsi va s-dsãcã: “<char style="it">Dumnidzãlu a meu, Dumnidzãlu a meu cãtse mi ai alãsat?</char>” <verse eid="MRK 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Shi niscãnts di atselji di aproapi, cãndu lu avdzãrã, dzãsirã: “Ia, elu ma greashti Ilia!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Atumtsea un di nãshi vini trãoarã sh-muljã un sfungar tu puscã, dupã tsi u bãgã tu un cãlami lji-lu deadi s-bea, dzãcãnda: “Alãsats-lu, s-videm ma cã va yinã Ilia s-lu dipun nghios.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Ma Isusul cum featsi un sghileari marã deadi suflitlu. <verse eid="MRK 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Shi velul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Velul easti unã pãndzã tsi dipartsi doauã udãdzili</char></note> tu templu s-disicã pi dau di nsus pãn nghios. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Shi centurionul tsi stãtea nãinti al Isus, cãndu vidzu cã Isusul zghili ashã, shi avea datã suflitlu, dzãsi: “Dealihea aestu om eara Hiljilu a Dumnidzãului!” <verse eid="MRK 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Atsia eara tutashã shi muljerili tsi videa di diparti, namisa di nãsi eara Maria Magdalena shi Maria, muma a Iacovul njiclu shi al Iose, shi Salomeia, <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>tsi lu avea urmat shi lã avea servitã di cãndu eara tu Galile, shi eara multi alti tsi avea vinit deadun cu elu tu Ierusalim.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngruparea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Tora s-apruchiã seara, cã eara Etimãsirea, tsi va s-dzãcã apãrirea di Sãmbãtã, <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>Iosif din Arimatea, un consilier respectat, cai ashtãpta amirãriljea a Dunmidzãului, cu curaiu intrã la Pilatul shi cãftã truplu al Isus. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Shi Pilatul s-ciudisi tsi tora elu avea murit. Lu acljimã centurionlu shi lu ntribã macã avea murit di mult chiro. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Shi cum sã siguripsi di centurionlu, lji lu alãsã truplu al Iosif. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Aestu, dupã tsi acumpãrã unã pãndzã, lu dipunã Isusul di crutsi, lu amvãrti cu pãndzã shi lu bãgã tu un murmintu tsi erea disfapt tu chiatrã, deapoea arucã un chiatrã dininti di usha a murmintului. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Shi Maria Magdalena shi Maria, muma al Iose mutrea iu lu bãgarã.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Injearea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Cum tricu Sãmbãta, Maria Magdalena shi Maria, muma al Iacovu, shi Salomea, acumpãrarã njurizmati s-nãdzea s-aundzea Isusul. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Dimineatsa tu prota dzuã a stãmãnãljei, multu curund, eali vinirã la murmint, cãndu ma insha soarili. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Shi dzãtsea namisa di nãsi: “Cai va nã arucuteascã cheatra di la intrarea a murmintului?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Ma cãndu scularã ocljilji, vidzurã cã cheatra eara arucutitã cu tutã cã eara multu mari. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Intrarã la murmintu shi vidzurã un tinir tsi eara apunat di nandreapta, nviscut cu albi, shi armasirã aspãrati. <verse eid="MRK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Shi elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Nu v-aspãrats! Voi cãftats Isus Nazareul tsi eara crutsisitã, elu s-injie, nu easti aoa. Ia, loclu iu eara bãgatã. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Ma imnats s-lã-dzãtsets a ucenitsilor a lui shi a Petrul cã elu ma s-dutsi dininti tu Galile, aclo va lu videts ashi cum vã dzãsi.” <verse eid="MRK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Shi eali inshirã trãoarã shi fudzirã dit murmint cã li acãtsã cutremburlu shi ciudia, shi nu lji-dzãsirã tsiva a nitsunã cãtse avea fricã.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isus Injeat Vidzut di Niscãntsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>[Tora Isusul dupã tsi eara injat dimineatsa tu prota dzuã a stãmãnãljei, s-fãnipsi prota ali Marii Magdalena, di la cai avea aĝiunit shapti demonji. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Ea s-dusi shi lu spusi atsilor tsi eara deadun cu nãsã tsi vãita shi plãndzea. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Ma aeshtsã cãndu avdzãrã cã eara yiu shi s-vidzu di ea nu lu pistipsirã. <verse eid="MRK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Dupã aesti lucri, s-fãnipsi tu unã altã formã a doilor di nãsh, tsi ma nãdzea tu hoarã. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Shi elji s-dusirã shi lu spusirã la alantsi, ma nitsi aeshti nu lu pistipsirã.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Injeat cu Ucenitsilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Tu soni s-fãnipsi a unsprãdzatsilor cãndu eara la measã shi l-aurlã trã nipistipsirea a lor shi trã chitrisirea a inimãljei, cã nu avea pistipsitã la nãsh tsi lu avea vidzutã injiat. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Dapoea lã dzãsi a lor: “Nidzets tu tutã lumea shi predicats evanghelul a tutulor, <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>atselu tsi pistipseashti shi s-pãtidzãshti, va s-hibã ascãpat. Ma atselu tsi nu ari pistipsit va s-hibã giudicat. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Shi aesti sãntu semnili tsi va s-urmeadzã atselji tsi va s-pistipseascã: tu numa a mea elji va li aĝuneascã demonjilji shi va s-greascã limbi nali, <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>shi va li acatsã cu mãna nãpãrtsili, shi macã va s-bea tsiva ti muriri, nu va s-facã tsiva arãu, va s-bagã mãnjili pi lãndzitsilji shi aeshti va s-vindicã.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Scularea al Isus tu Tser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Domnul Isus, dupã tsi lã gri, si sculã pi tser shi s-apunã di nandreapta a Dumnidzãului. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Dapoea elji fudzirã shi predicarã iutsido, iarã Domnul lucra deadun cu nãshi shi lu confirma zborlu cu seamnili tsi li sotsãsea. Amen.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9-20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aesti stihuri nu s-aflã tu alti manuscrisi</char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
